translate schinese Emiko_Prologue_H_Replay_6abb5a1a:

    # k "Unfortunately, a decade ago, said institution suffered a depletion of financial resources and the proprietors filed for bankruptcy."
    k "可惜十年前，该机构资金链断裂，校方申请了破产。"

# game/script.rpy:1298
