translate schinese intro_start_5a096f96:

    # k "There are, however, many aspects of the position that I must make you aware of before you can freely make decisions of your own."
    k "不过，在你能够自行决策之前，关于这个职位有很多方面我必须让你了解。"

# game/script.rpy:2631
translate schinese intro_start_025ec281:

    # k "But before we begin, please take a seat at your desk while I get the reports ready for you to analyze."
    k "但在我们开始之前，请先在你的办公桌前坐下，我把报告准备好，供你分析。"

# game/script.rpy:2632
translate schinese intro_start_5e44a000:

    # mc "Right..."
    mc "好的……"

# game/script.rpy:2635
translate schinese intro_start_13b9d3d1:

    # mc "Hm... That book must be very important, right?" with d
    mc "嗯……那本书一定很重要吧？" with d

# game/script.rpy:2636
translate schinese intro_start_7ea7baa0:

    # mc "Every time I see you, you're holding that thing."
    mc "每次见到你，你都拿着那东西。"

# game/script.rpy:2638
translate schinese intro_start_1a79a099:

    # k "This is our Academy Report Book."
    k "这是我们学院的报告册。"

# game/script.rpy:2639
translate schinese intro_start_40f600b0:

    # k "It is where I organize all the useful information about our facility, our staff members, and our students."
    k "我把关于我们设施、教职员工和学生的所有有用信息都整理在里面。"

# game/script.rpy:2640
translate schinese intro_start_98af6c75:

    # k "As well as take note of some of the Board requests and some of my own annotations."
    k "同时也会记下一些董事会的要求和我自己的一些批注。"

# game/script.rpy:2641
translate schinese intro_start_db48841e:

    # k "With the intent of presenting it to our esteemed Presiden-..."
    k "本来是要呈交给受人尊敬的高校校——"

# game/script.rpy:2645
translate schinese intro_start_9aea6659:

    # k "With the intent of presenting it to you... Mr. [mc]." with d
    k "本来是要呈交给您的……[mc]先生。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2647
translate schinese intro_start_ade66f4a:

    # mc "... Still getting used to it, I see."
    mc "……还在适应啊，我看出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:2648
translate schinese intro_start_97f7406f:

    # mc "Well, I'm sure it was very useful to the President."
    mc "嗯，我相信这对理事长来说非常有用。"

# game/script.rpy:2649
translate schinese intro_start_9d9f66e3:

    # mc "But considering how this Academy functions, there must be all sorts of stuff in there."
    mc "不过考虑到这所学院的运作方式，里面肯定塞满了各种各样的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:2651
translate schinese intro_start_8cb642d7:

    # k "There are... various reports that are pertinent to our Academy functioning, yes."
    k "确实有……各种与我们学院运作相关的报告。"

# game/script.rpy:2652
translate schinese intro_start_b0930089:

    # k "This will be your main tool for performing your job, so its usefulness needs to be thoroughly explained."
    k "这将是你履行职务的主要工具，所以它的用法必须彻底讲清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:2653
translate schinese intro_start_21912d44:

    # k "So we should begin it at once."
    k "所以我们这就立刻开始。"

# game/script.rpy:2655
translate schinese intro_start_9546a2f6:

    # mc "Hey now... Shouldn't you ask if I have any initial questions before you begin explaining a bunch of things?"
    mc "喂喂……在我开始讲解一大堆东西之前，你不是该先问问有没有什么最初的问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2656
translate schinese intro_start_0ac0ff32:

    # mc "That's usually how these presentations go, right?"
    mc "这种说明会通常都是这么进行的，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2658
translate schinese intro_start_8ebc0cc6:

    # k "... Fine."
    k "……好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2659
translate schinese intro_start_8c82470d:

    # k "Do you have any questions before we begin?"
    k "在我们开始之前，你有什么问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2667
translate schinese intro_start_fa7ad27f:

    # mc "So...{w} You seemed very close to the {i}Academy President{/i}..." with d
    mc "那个……{w}你看起来和{i}学院理事长{/i}……" with d

# game/script.rpy:2668
translate schinese intro_start_8073651d:

    # mc "You treat him in such high regard."
    mc "你非常尊敬他。"

# game/script.rpy:2669
translate schinese intro_start_6a9ab8cc:

    # mc "What's the deal between you two? Are you and him in a... relationship?"
    mc "你们之间到底是怎么回事？你和他是……关系吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2671
translate schinese intro_start_bbc2ec57:

    # k "The Academy President is a very competent person. And I... {i}was{/i} fortunate enough to work for him."
    k "学院理事长是个非常有能力的人。而我……{i}曾经{/i}有幸为他工作。"

# game/script.rpy:2672
translate schinese intro_start_8ad39606:

    # k "He taught me many things and I have developed professionally thanks to him."
    k "他教会了我很多东西，多亏了他我才能在职业上有所成长。"

# game/script.rpy:2673
translate schinese intro_start_7fadd6cf:

    # k "Now, should we begin the presentation?"
    k "那么，我们开始说明吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2675
translate schinese intro_start_54ef7062:

    # mct "(She's trying to dodge the actual question I just made...)"
    mct "（她在回避我刚才真正问的问题……）"

# game/script.rpy:2676
translate schinese intro_start_c1452420:

    # mct "(Should I prod deeper and try to have her answer it properly?)"
    mct "（我是不是该再追问深一点，让她好好回答？）"

# game/script.rpy:2677
translate schinese intro_start_e30ed576:

    # mct "(Or maybe this is something best left for another time...?)"
    mct "（还是说这种事最好留到以后再说……？）"

# game/script.rpy:2682
translate schinese intro_start_f65aa0d6:

    # mc "Come on, [k]...{w} You're smart. You know that's not what I {i}really{/i} asked, right?" with d
    mc "拜托，[k]……{w}你很聪明的。你知道我{i}真正{/i}想问的不是那个，对吧？" with d

# game/script.rpy:2683
translate schinese intro_start_c68af07a:

    # mc "There's obviously something between you two."
    mc "你们两个之间肯定有什么。"

# game/script.rpy:2685
translate schinese intro_start_1ea1b990:

    # k "... Your {i}real{/i} question is highly inappropriate."
    k "……你那个{i}真正{/i}的问题很不得体。"

# game/script.rpy:2687
translate schinese intro_start_32fd56c8:

    # mc "Okay, fine... Let's start with something simple then."
    mc "好吧……那就先从简单的问题开始吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2688
translate schinese intro_start_ae39c2da:

    # mc "For starters. I don't even know his name..."
    mc "首先。我甚至不知道他的名字……"

# game/script.rpy:2689
translate schinese intro_start_57328b94:

    # mc "You only say \"Mr. President\" and never properly introduce him."
    mc "你只会叫「理事长先生」，从来没正式介绍过他。"

# game/script.rpy:2690
translate schinese intro_start_180437f9:

    # mc "Is that supposed to be a mystery as well?"
    mc "这也算是个谜吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2692
translate schinese intro_start_83182d9c:

    # k "I believe there will not be an issue with you knowing his name."
    k "我相信让你知道他的名字不会有什么问题。"

# game/script.rpy:2693
translate schinese intro_start_576cb5fa:

    # k "The Academy President's name is {i}[president.surname], [president.name]{/i}."
    k "学院理事长的名字是{i}[president.surname]，[president.name]{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:2694
translate schinese intro_start_c9cb8b7f:

    # k "... Now. Is that it?"
    k "……好了。就这样？"

# game/script.rpy:2700
translate schinese intro_start_c2edd74f:

    # mc "Okay... Good start." with d
    mc "很好……问得不错。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2701
translate schinese intro_start_112887ba:

    # mc "See, it wasn't that hard!"
    mc "看，也没那么难吧！"

# game/script.rpy:2703
translate schinese intro_start_fec32f32:

    # k "If there aren't more irrelevant questions, we should start the presentation."
    k "如果没什么无关紧要的问题了，我们就该开始说明了。"

# game/script.rpy:2705
translate schinese intro_start_de6bddc5:

    # mc "Hold on, [k]..."
    mc "等一下，[k]……"

# game/script.rpy:2706
translate schinese intro_start_437fc3a0:

    # mc "About you and... {i}[president.name]{/i}."
    mc "关于你和……{i}[president.name]{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:2708
translate schinese intro_start_a91cc060:

    # k "It's disrespectful for you to call the Academy President by his first name."
    k "直呼学院理事长的名字是很不尊重的。"

# game/script.rpy:2710
translate schinese intro_start_92984e35:

    # mc "Relax..."
    mc "放轻松……"

# game/script.rpy:2711
translate schinese intro_start_76431a0a:

    # mc "... You and him have a close relationship, right?"
    mc "……你和他关系很好，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2713
translate schinese intro_start_061ef800:

    # k "I must admit that your definition of \"close\" must be very different from what I believe it is."
    k "我得承认，你对「关系好」的定义，大概和我理解的相当不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:2714
translate schinese intro_start_184dad65:

    # k "So I'll say this..."
    k "所以我直说了……"

# game/script.rpy:2716
translate schinese intro_start_99d7efaa:

    # k "I owe a lot to the Academy President, therefore, my high regard towards him is directly correlated to this feeling."
    k "我欠学院理事长很多，所以我对他的敬重也是直接源自这份感情。"

# game/script.rpy:2718
translate schinese intro_start_a651215d:

    # mc "And why do you owe him that much?"
    mc "那你为什么会欠他这么多？"

# game/script.rpy:2720
translate schinese intro_start_4d295d8a:

    # k "Do you not get tired of asking senseless questions?"
    k "你就不觉得问这些毫无意义的问题很烦吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2721
translate schinese intro_start_b17e4a62:

    # k "We should begin this presentation at once."
    k "我们该立刻开始说明了。"

# game/script.rpy:2724
translate schinese intro_start_0b763d5d:

    # mc "Okay, you're right... But how about you answer just this last question, then I'll stop insisting on this topic..."
    mc "好吧，你说得对……但你能不能就回答这最后一个问题，之后我就不再纠缠这个话题了……"

# game/script.rpy:2725
translate schinese intro_start_7b6eb2df:

    # mc "Can you do that?"
    mc "你能做到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2726
translate schinese intro_start_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/script.rpy:2729
translate schinese intro_start_c7ed0964:

    # k "Fine." with d
    k "好吧。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2735
translate schinese intro_start_3a0f2f01:

    # k "There was a time where I was in a very unfavorable position in my life." with d
    k "我的人生曾经有一段时间处境非常艰难。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2736
translate schinese intro_start_80d309d2:

    # k "I did not have many opportunities and had to take care of other people that relied on me."
    k "我没有多少机会，还得照顾那些依赖我的人。"

# game/script.rpy:2738
translate schinese intro_start_97de0411:

    # mc "People that relied on you? Family?"
    mc "依赖你的人？家人？"

# game/script.rpy:2741
translate schinese intro_start_052fd884:

    # k "My... sister."
    k "我的……姐姐。"

# game/script.rpy:2743
translate schinese intro_start_b8de06d3:

    # mc "Oh."
    mc "哦。"

# game/script.rpy:2745
translate schinese intro_start_61b04fd9:

    # k "We didn't have much in the way of financial resources. I wasn't a very educated person back then, and most of the ways available to acquire financial support were... distasteful, to say the least."
    k "我们当时没什么钱。我那时也没受过多少教育，而能获得经济支援的手段……说实话，大半都让人很难堪。"

# game/script.rpy:2746
translate schinese intro_start_4e8d6ade:

    # k "There wasn't much that I could do, so I was stuck."
    k "我也做不了什么，就这样被困住了。"

# game/script.rpy:2747
translate schinese intro_start_0758b3be:

    # k "It was then that Mr. Matsuzaki appeared and offered me help."
    k "就在那时，松崎先生出现了，向我伸出了援手。"

# game/script.rpy:2748
translate schinese intro_start_243a1cde:

    # k "Asking nothing in return, he offered me an opportunity to learn many different skills and would also help me financially so I could provide for my sister."
    k "他不求任何回报，给我机会学习各种技能，还在经济上帮助我，让我能养活姐姐。"

# game/script.rpy:2749
translate schinese intro_start_d4b33cf7:

    # k "After that, he placed me in a position to be his assistant, and so, I faithfully did. In an attempt to repay the favor that I owed to him by being the best I could."
    k "之后他让我担任他的助手，于是我便尽职地做好了这份工作，尽全力报答他的恩情。"

# game/script.rpy:2750
translate schinese intro_start_e187fe45:

    # k "And then, I performed my job at his side..."
    k "然后，我就这样在他身边工作……"

# game/script.rpy:2754
translate schinese intro_start_c00ca69b:

    # k "... Until now." with d
    k "……直到现在。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2756
translate schinese intro_start_a7bcf340:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "我明白了……"

# game/script.rpy:2758
translate schinese intro_start_e102cf46:

    # mc "So he isn't evil?" with d
    mc "所以他不是坏人？" with d

# game/script.rpy:2760
translate schinese intro_start_84d57fec:

    # k "... What kind of question is that?"
    k "……这算什么问题？"

# game/script.rpy:2762
translate schinese intro_start_dc7989e3:

    # mc "Well... If you look at the things he is trying to do with this Academy..."
    mc "嗯……如果你看看他想要对这所学院做的事……"

# game/script.rpy:2763
translate schinese intro_start_5df8f1de:

    # mc "Seems very dubious."
    mc "看起来相当可疑。"

# game/script.rpy:2765
translate schinese intro_start_57bff2a7:

    # k "The way I see it, he is offering help to you in a time of need."
    k "在我看来，他是在你走投无路时向你伸出了援手。"

# game/script.rpy:2766
translate schinese intro_start_38a93751:

    # k "Just as he once offered me."
    k "就像他当年对我做的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:2767
translate schinese intro_start_13888085:

    # k "And you would be wise to accept and make the most out of it."
    k "而你最好明智地接受它，并好好利用。"

# game/script.rpy:2769
translate schinese intro_start_ea465582:

    # mc "Yeah... That's one way to interpret it..."
    mc "嗯……这倒也是一种解读方式……"

# game/script.rpy:2770
translate schinese intro_start_9780c793:

    # mc "Thanks for answering, [k]."
    mc "谢谢你回答我，[k]。"

# game/script.rpy:2771
translate schinese intro_start_a72afcd7:

    # mct "(That was a somewhat naive way of looking at it...)"
    mct "（这想法还真是有点天真……）"

# game/script.rpy:2772
translate schinese intro_start_e1442418:

    # mct "(To me it just sounds like he is taking advantage of my desperate position.)"
    mct "（在我听来，更像是他在利用我走投无路的处境。）"

# game/script.rpy:2773
translate schinese intro_start_fbf66dc8:

    # mct "(I guess she's too obsessed to see it.)"
    mct "（看来她太执着，看不出来。）"

# game/script.rpy:2775
translate schinese intro_start_ccdfbee4:

    # k "With that being said..."
    k "话虽如此……"

# game/script.rpy:2776
translate schinese intro_start_86c119d7:

    # k "Are there any more questions, or should we begin?"
    k "还有什么问题吗，还是我们开始？"

# game/script.rpy:2780
translate schinese intro_start_b4d449c5:

    # mc "Okay, I'll leave it at that." with d
    mc "好，那就到这里。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2781
translate schinese intro_start_910686fe:

    # mc "About the other questions..."
    mc "关于其他问题……"

# game/script.rpy:2784
translate schinese intro_start_b4d449c5_1:

    # mc "Okay, I'll leave it at that." with d
    mc "好，那就到这里。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2785
translate schinese intro_start_910686fe_1:

    # mc "About the other questions..."
    mc "关于其他问题……"

# game/script.rpy:2791
translate schinese intro_start_eaaff4e8:

    # mc "So... Mr. {i}[president.surname]{/i} recruited me for this position, and I have to please this mysterious \"Board\"." with d
    mc "所以……{i}[president.surname]{/i}先生招揽我来做这份工作，而我得讨好那个神秘的『董事会』。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2793
translate schinese intro_start_882fbdd9:

    # mc "So... The Academy President recruited me for this position, and I have to please this mysterious \"Board\"." with d
    mc "所以……学院理事长招揽我来做这份工作，而我得讨好那个神秘的「董事会」。"with d

# game/script.rpy:2794
translate schinese intro_start_5d122b68:

    # mc "And they, in return, ask me to provide content for some also mysterious \"viewers\"."
    mc "而他们则要求我，为某些同样神秘的「观众」提供内容。"

# game/script.rpy:2796
translate schinese intro_start_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/script.rpy:2798
translate schinese intro_start_2947f855:

    # mc "Everything seems rather mysterious here."
    mc "这里的一切都挺神秘的。"

# game/script.rpy:2799
translate schinese intro_start_4179c363:

    # mc "Do we know who these viewers are, at least?"
    mc "至少，这些观众是谁我们知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2800
translate schinese intro_start_8d736049:

    # mc "Isn't it very risky to have this footage available to random people? Can't someone just expose everything and all of this goes to shit?"
    mc "让随机的人都能看到这些影像，风险不是很大吗？难道不会有人一把揭发，让这一切全完蛋？"

# game/script.rpy:2802
translate schinese intro_start_9386d83d:

    # k "It is true that our viewers are anonymous, and it is known that this could cause certain risks..."
    k "确实，我们的观众是匿名的，而且大家也都知道这会带来一定的风险……"

# game/script.rpy:2803
translate schinese intro_start_f3b1e04f:

    # k "However, access to our cameras is not handily given to anyone."
    k "不过，摄像机的访问权限并不是随便就能拿到的。"

# game/script.rpy:2804
translate schinese intro_start_c577631e:

    # k "First of all, it is an invite only group, where access is given by the members of our Board to people they trust."
    k "首先，那是一个仅限受邀的群组，访问权限由董事会成员授予他们信任的人。"

# game/script.rpy:2805
translate schinese intro_start_6a8c184c:

    # k "And of course, these viewers pay for their access in a subscription-based model."
    k "当然，这些观众也要按订阅制付费才能访问。"

# game/script.rpy:2807
translate schinese intro_start_bb1009fa:

    # mc "And we receive the money from these viewers then?"
    mc "也就是说，钱是从这些观众那里收来的？"

# game/script.rpy:2809
translate schinese intro_start_372287db:

    # k "... The Board does."
    k "……是董事会在收。"

# game/script.rpy:2810
translate schinese intro_start_26b994ee:

    # k "And they, in part, provide payment to you and every member of our staff."
    k "然后他们再部分支付给你和我们的每一位教职员工。"

# game/script.rpy:2812
translate schinese intro_start_1229f53c:

    # mc "So it's like an elite group of rich anonymous horny people?"
    mc "所以这就像是一群有钱的匿名发情人士组成的精英团体？"

# game/script.rpy:2814
translate schinese intro_start_9c50d5f8:

    # k "If you'd like to put it that way, then yes..."
    k "如果你非要这么说的话，那也没错……"

# game/script.rpy:2816
translate schinese intro_start_2e7c9b83:

    # k "If that's all, I suggest we begin the presentation."
    k "如果没问题了，我建议我们开始说明。"

# game/script.rpy:2817
translate schinese intro_start_f0f1b635:

    # k "This and many other similar questions will be answered when we're done."
    k "这个问题和许多类似的问题，等结束之后都会得到解答。"

# game/script.rpy:2821
translate schinese intro_start_c03b797a:

    # mc "No questions." with d
    mc "没有问题。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2827
translate schinese intro_start_90f1103d:

    # k "..." with d
    k "……" with d

# game/script.rpy:2829
translate schinese intro_start_a9604b29:

    # k "Why did you...?"
    k "你为什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:2831
translate schinese intro_start_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/script.rpy:2833
translate schinese intro_start_fe9c90a7:

    # k "Doesn't matter..." with d
    k "算了……" with d

# game/script.rpy:2834
translate schinese intro_start_8d28bd06:

    # k "However, I must remind you once again that you being in this highly regarded position means the Academy President has put his total trust in you running this Academy in an efficient manner."
    k "不过我必须再提醒你一次：你身处这个备受瞩目的职位，意味着学院理事长把全部信任都交给了你，由你来高效地运营这所学院。"

# game/script.rpy:2835
translate schinese intro_start_615ae87a:

    # k "If you fail this job, you will not only fail the President, but you will make his choices look dubious in the eyes of the Board."
    k "如果你搞砸了这份工作，你不只是辜负了理事长，还会让董事会上的人觉得他的选择站不住脚。"

# game/script.rpy:2839
translate schinese intro_start_1aa38d26:

    # mc "Relax, [k]..."
    mc "放轻松，[k]……"

# game/script.rpy:2840
translate schinese intro_start_c3807778:

    # mc "Look... We're going to be working together a lot from now on, right? You don't have to act so stiff and serious all the time."
    mc "你看……以后我们要长期共事，不是吗？你不用总是这么一本正经、这么严肃。"

# game/script.rpy:2841
translate schinese intro_start_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/script.rpy:2842
translate schinese intro_start_366fc16c:

    # mct "(I guess it'll take some time for her to relax a little around me.)"
    mct "（我想她需要一点时间才能在我面前放松一些。）"

# game/script.rpy:2843
translate schinese intro_start_3b9f262e:

    # mct "(If that's even possible...)"
    mct "（如果她做得到的话……）"

# game/script.rpy:2846
translate schinese intro_start_01c441da:

    # k "Should I begin the presentation then?" with d
    k "那我要开始说明了吗？" with d

# game/script.rpy:2850
translate schinese intro_start_b55c2240:

    # mc "That would be all, thanks for answering, [k]." with d
    mc "就到这里，谢谢你回答，[k]。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2852
translate schinese intro_start_88ae75e6:

    # k "Of course."
    k "不客气。"

# game/script.rpy:2853
translate schinese intro_start_35a43667:

    # k "Now, I assume you're ready for the presentation?"
    k "那么，我猜你已经准备好听说明了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2858
translate schinese intro_start_3d508c1a:

    # "Do you want to watch the presentation? {size=15}(Tutorial){/size}" with d
    "要看说明吗?{size=15}(教程){/size}" with d

# game/script.rpy:2863
translate schinese intro_start_cdee5167:

    # mc "I'm as ready as I'll ever be." with d
    mc "我准备好了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2865
translate schinese intro_start_85ceb222:

    # k "Good."
    k "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:2866
translate schinese intro_start_8a8c058e:

    # k "Then let me explain the specifics of your task and how to manage the Academy."
    k "那么，让我来解释一下你任务的具体内容，以及如何管理这所学院。"

# game/script.rpy:2868
translate schinese intro_start_8b409f2b:

    # k "As it was discussed before, this will be your main workplace inside {i}ReLive Academy{/i}." with d
    k "正如之前说过的，这里将是你在{i}ReLive 学院{/i}的主要工作场所。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2869
translate schinese intro_start_e32e784c:

    # k "And where you will make decisions that will affect the day-to-day functioning of the facilities, its students and staff members, and, of course, the direction that our project takes."
    k "你将在此做出影响设施日常运作、学生与教职员工，以及我们项目走向的决定。"

# game/script.rpy:2870
translate schinese intro_start_1e5ed8d7:

    # k "However, seeing as this project has some differing characteristics from your typical school, I'm sure you will find that your objectives towards the ideal functioning of the Academy are somewhat different as well."
    k "不过，鉴于这个项目与你以往的学校有些不同，我想你也会发现，你对学院理想运作的着眼点会有所不同。"

# game/script.rpy:2875
translate schinese intro_start_e860d69c:

    # k "This project has had its inception based on the vision that the Academy President had. And it was then proposed to our anonymous group of shareholders." with d
    k "这个项目最初是基于学院理事长的构想诞生的。之后，提案被提交给了我们那群匿名的股东。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2876
translate schinese intro_start_d1cb13f2:

    # k "... Or, as we'll call them from now on, our Board of Trustees, or simply {b}Board{/b}."
    k "……或者，按照我们之后的叫法，董事会，简称{b}董事会{/b}。"

# game/script.rpy:2877
translate schinese intro_start_18d189c9:

    # k "Since they are the ones behind the funding of the project, they are the highest authority and the ones whom you will strive to please."
    k "既然他们是项目资金的来源，那他们就是最高权力者，也是你需要努力取悦的人。"

# game/script.rpy:2878
translate schinese intro_start_aea0ac69:

    # k "Therefore, their satisfaction with the functioning of the Academy is of utmost importance. And they will let you know of any misstep you might've taken."
    k "所以，他们对学院运作是否满意，是最重要的事。他们会让你知道自己犯下了什么差错。"

# game/script.rpy:2879
translate schinese intro_start_c9dd2cb6:

    # k "So keep that in mind and always pay attention to the Board's happiness with your performance."
    k "因此请记住这一点，永远关注董事会对你工作表现是否满意。"

# game/script.rpy:2883
translate schinese intro_start_0c30fb1b:

    # k "Keep in mind, however, that even though they trust in the Academy President's vision of how this Academy should perform and, consequently, they should trust in your management of it..."
    k "不过请记住，虽然他们信任学院理事长对学院运作的构想，因而也应该信任你的管理……"

# game/script.rpy:2884
translate schinese intro_start_b205ccdc:

    # k "They will, in some occasions, make some specific requests and/or ask you to steer the Academy in a certain direction."
    k "但他们有时会提出一些具体要求，或者要求你把学院引向某个方向。"

# game/script.rpy:2885
translate schinese intro_start_92e2836c:

    # k "And it would be in your best interests to comply with the Board's desires. After all, they're the ones who allow you to maintain your job position at our Academy."
    k "顺从董事会的意愿，对你是最有利的。毕竟，是你让他们能让你继续坐在学院这个职位上。"

# game/script.rpy:2890
translate schinese intro_start_76acbee5:

    # k "There are other reports to keep an eye on as well."
    k "还有一些其他报告也需要你留意。"

# game/script.rpy:2891
translate schinese intro_start_b90d14a2:

    # k "I will provide and update some reports that should help you manage some aspects of how the Academy is operating."
    k "我会提供并更新一些报告，应该能帮助你管理学院运营中的各个方面。"

# game/script.rpy:2892
translate schinese intro_start_a707e324:

    # k "And four of these main aspects are what I like to call: {i}Students' Trust, Academic Performance, Academic Perversion Level, and Viewership Results."
    k "其中四个主要方面，我称之为：{i}学生信任度、学业成绩、学业淫乱度、以及收视成绩。"

# game/script.rpy:2897
translate schinese intro_start_f7b79b2e:

    # k "{i}Students' Trust{/i} is a measure of how much the Students place their trust in our program."
    k "{i}学生信任度{/i}衡量的是学生对我们的计划有多大程度的信任。"

# game/script.rpy:2898
translate schinese intro_start_69228cae:

    # k "Seeing as they have no knowledge of our real intentions..."
    k "由于他们对我们真正的意图一无所知……"

# game/script.rpy:2899
translate schinese intro_start_3f2a117f:

    # k "... This will basically mean how much they believe that the main objective of our Academy is to graduate them in the usual fashion that a regular teaching institute would."
    k "……这基本上就等于他们有多相信，我们学院的主要目标，是像普通教育机构那样以常规方式让他们毕业。"

# game/script.rpy:2900
translate schinese intro_start_845c07bd:

    # k "Therefore, providing good classes, treating them with respect, or just providing a helpful and friendly environment will reinforce that trust."
    k "因此，提供高质量的课程、尊重地对待他们，或者只是营造一个友善而有帮助的环境，都能强化这种信任。"

# game/script.rpy:2901
translate schinese intro_start_f0d4408b:

    # k "And, as you might've imagined, it should be vital to nurture some trust between our students and our Academy in order to have them not question the nature of some things as much as they normally would."
    k "而且，正如你可能已经猜到的，让学生与学院之间培养起一定的信任，应该至关重要，这样他们才不会像平常那样去质疑某些事情的性质。"

# game/script.rpy:2906
translate schinese intro_start_db7503bf:

    # k "And now, onto our next aspect. {i}Academic Performance{/i}."
    k "接下来是下一个方面。{i}学业成绩{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:2907
translate schinese intro_start_e3748d4b:

    # k "This will be the one that you're most familiar with. As it is one that should be commonplace in teaching institutions that possess grading systems."
    k "这个应该是你最熟悉的一项了。毕竟在任何有评分制度的教育机构里，这一项都很常见。"

# game/script.rpy:2908
translate schinese intro_start_b3dabab1:

    # k "It represents the average grade that our Students have scored on our weekly tests."
    k "它代表我们学生每周测验的平均分数。"

# game/script.rpy:2909
translate schinese intro_start_cca71ae0:

    # k "Therefore, it needs little explanation as I'm sure you're aware of how it should work... The better our students are performing, the better grades they'll have."
    k "所以应该不用多解释，我想你也知道它是怎么运作的……我们学生表现越好，分数就越高。"

# game/script.rpy:2910
translate schinese intro_start_1d15a1e8:

    # k "However... There is one aspect about it that should make it {b}very{/b} important to our main objective."
    k "不过……关于它有一点，让它对我们的主要目标来说{b}格外{/b}重要。"

# game/script.rpy:2911
translate schinese intro_start_43bef105:

    # k "According to our true intentions, we have purposely made it so that our tests are somewhat more difficult than they should normally be."
    k "按照我们真正的意图，我们刻意把测验弄得比正常情况要难一些。"

# game/script.rpy:2912
translate schinese intro_start_a494cc8f:

    # k "And so, it is expected that our students' average grade would be lower than you would expect."
    k "因此，学生们的平均分数会比你预期的要低，这也是预料之中的。"

# game/script.rpy:2913
translate schinese intro_start_fa937ed4:

    # k "The intent of that is so that students would find themselves in greater need of assistance with their classes and also more willing to trade favors for extra grading, in order to keep up with our academic standards."
    k "这样做的目的，是让学生们更加需要有人辅导功课，也更愿意为了额外的评分而与我们交换好处，以维持我们的学业标准。"

# game/script.rpy:2914
translate schinese intro_start_cbfa8c02:

    # k "This is where you come in..."
    k "这就是你派上用场的地方……"

# game/script.rpy:2915
translate schinese intro_start_f9b1857f:

    # k "You have every incentive to help the students, should they be willing to exchange favors for those benefits."
    k "只要学生愿意为这些好处交换好处，你就有充分的理由去帮他们。"

# game/script.rpy:2916
translate schinese intro_start_0550f49f:

    # k "And, of course, the nature of those favors could very well be something that would benefit our viewers."
    k "而且，这些「好处」的性质，很可能正是会让我们的观众受益的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:2921
translate schinese intro_start_60e040d4:

    # k "That ties in well with our next topic.{w}{i} Academic Perversion Level{/i}."
    k "这就正好接到我们下一个话题。{w}{i}学业淫乱度{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2922
translate schinese intro_start_29abb236:

    # k "This is a representation of how well you are doing your job of making the students be more open about their desires and, therefore, perform more content for our cameras."
    k "它反映的是，你让学生们对自己的欲望更加坦承、从而为我们的摄像机献上更多内容的这项工作，做得有多好。"

# game/script.rpy:2923
translate schinese intro_start_5df6a8a4:

    # k "This will also provide you with an useful indicator of how perverted they are, in order to perform some sexual actions."
    k "它还能给你一个有用的指标，让你知道她们有多好色，以此来决定她们愿意做出哪些性行为。"

# game/script.rpy:2924
translate schinese intro_start_5c67f787:

    # k "The higher this stat, the more sexual acts they'd be willing to perform."
    k "这项数值越高，她们愿意做出的性行为就越多。"

# game/script.rpy:2925
translate schinese intro_start_60a4aa1b:

    # k "And, of course, it is expected that you will be striving to perform a constant rise of this stat."
    k "而且，你可以预期，这项数值会持续被你不断拉高。"

# game/script.rpy:2926
translate schinese intro_start_3fd12e2e:

    # k "It is one of the stats the Board will be taking a closer look at. And, as time goes by, you will be expected to make this value ever higher."
    k "这是董事会会重点关注的数值之一。而且随着时间推移，你会需要把这个值弄得越来越高。"

# game/script.rpy:2931
translate schinese intro_start_82acd06d:

    # k "Finally, our {i}Viewership Results{/i}."
    k "最后是我们的{i}收视成绩{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:2932
translate schinese intro_start_fb51906f:

    # k "This represents our engagement levels and how interested the viewers are in our content."
    k "它反映的是我们的参与度，以及观众对我们内容的兴趣程度。"

# game/script.rpy:2933
translate schinese intro_start_d401726e:

    # k "The more quality content you manage to provide to them, the more viewers we will get."
    k "你能为他们提供的优质内容越多，我们能吸引到的观众就越多。"

# game/script.rpy:2934
translate schinese intro_start_9c9c9128:

    # k "There is also something to note."
    k "还有一点需要注意。"

# game/script.rpy:2935
translate schinese intro_start_0887bd35:

    # k "Some of our patrons are enthusiastic enough to be willing to donate large sums of money to our project."
    k "我们有些赞助者热情高涨，愿意为我们的项目捐出大笔金钱。"

# game/script.rpy:2936
translate schinese intro_start_4b52af17:

    # k "However, in those instances, these donations could be tied to some specific requests that they desire."
    k "不过在这种情况下，这些捐款可能会附带他们想要的某些具体要求。"

# game/script.rpy:2937
translate schinese intro_start_6df53905:

    # k "The Board would be more than happy if you manage to satisfy some of these requests."
    k "如果你能满足其中一些要求，董事会会非常高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:2938
translate schinese intro_start_4e8099e7:

    # k "I like to call these \"Bounties\". And I'll be sure to let you know if any of them have been requested."
    k "我把这些叫作「悬赏」。有任何一个悬出来时，我一定会通知你。"

# game/script.rpy:2941
translate schinese intro_start_b950f5d2:

    # k "Those are the biggest factors that you would be wise to keep track of." with dd
    k "这些是你明智的话就应当留意的最大要素。" with dd

# game/script.rpy:2942
translate schinese intro_start_060248a6:

    # k "I will always try to provide you with a report about those statistics so that you can make informed decisions."
    k "我会一直为你提供关于这些数据的报告，好让你做出有根据的决策。"

# game/script.rpy:2948
translate schinese intro_start_a014d5d6:

    # k "Should you wish to know the specific numbers of those statistics, those are also provided for you in the expanded reports I'll be giving to you."
    k "如果你想知道这些数据的具体数值，在我给你的展开版报告里也会一并提供。"

# game/script.rpy:2949
translate schinese intro_start_612a9c48:

    # k "So keep track of them as you see fit."
    k "所以你想怎么记录就怎么记录吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2954
translate schinese intro_start_b25897fa:

    # k "And that about covers the various indicators I'll be providing to you."
    k "我要提供的各项指标，大致就是这些了。"

# game/script.rpy:2956
translate schinese intro_start_277bedfd:

    # mc "Okay, okay..."
    mc "好，好吧……"

# game/script.rpy:2957
translate schinese intro_start_700f965d:

    # mc "I... {i}think{/i} I get it...?"
    mc "我……{i}大概{/i}明白了……？"

# game/script.rpy:2958
translate schinese intro_start_92b34185:

    # mc "... And what about the book... The {i}Academy Report Book{/i}.{w} Is that it?"
    mc "……那那本书呢……{i}学院报告册{/i}。{w}就这些？"

# game/script.rpy:2959
translate schinese intro_start_38356060:

    # mc "Is there something in there for me? Can I take a look, or do you write some personal stuff in there as well, like a diary?"
    mc "那里面有什么是我的吗？我能看看吗，还是说你也会在里面写些私人的东西，比如日记之类的？"

# game/script.rpy:2964
translate schinese intro_start_57ffd186:

    # k "Everything that I have written in the Academy Report Book is intended for you to see." with d
    k "我写在学院报告册里的所有内容，都是给你看的。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2965
translate schinese intro_start_7d04be76:

    # k "You might have noticed that, until this moment, I have only given you statistics and reports about numbers that are related to various aspects of the Academy."
    k "你可能已经注意到了，到目前为止我只给你看过一些统计数据，以及与学院各方面的数字有关的报告。"

# game/script.rpy:2966
translate schinese intro_start_dfca4eb5:

    # k "This Book, however, will be your main instrument in managing the Academy."
    k "但这本书才是你管理学院的主要工具。"

# game/script.rpy:2967
translate schinese intro_start_1806ac00:

    # k "You'll be able to make choices and decide how our Academy operates."
    k "你可以借此做出选择，决定我们学院如何运作。"

# game/script.rpy:2968
translate schinese intro_start_9c5f0de2:

    # k "It also provides you with additional information about some specific aspects that are not detailed in the previous reports..."
    k "它还会提供一些前面报告里没有详述的特定方面的额外信息……"

# game/script.rpy:2969
translate schinese intro_start_24199d0f:

    # k "... Such as information about our Students and Staff Members, Board Requests, and Bounties."
    k "……比如关于我们学生和教职员工的信息、董事会要求，以及悬赏。"

# game/script.rpy:2971
translate schinese intro_start_cecd85fb:

    # k "However, only putting it into words would not convey the contents inside the Book." with d
    k "不过，光用言语是传达不了书中内容的。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2972
translate schinese intro_start_8b67ff87:

    # k "See for yourself and I'll explain what it contains."
    k "你自己看吧，我来给你解释里面有什么。"

# game/script.rpy:2974
translate schinese intro_start_5284cbbd:

    # mc "Okay... Let's see this thing." with d
    mc "好吧……让我看看这东西。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2976
translate schinese intro_start_fc6912bd:

    # mc "Mmhm...{w} Mhmm..." with d
    mc "唔嗯……{w}嗯嗯……" with d

# game/script.rpy:2977
translate schinese intro_start_bb3b7046:

    # mc "...{w} I see."
    mc "……{w}我明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:2979
translate schinese intro_start_c6999689:

    # mct "(I don't know what any of that means...)" with d
    mct "（我完全不知道那是什么意思……）" with d

# game/script.rpy:2981
translate schinese intro_start_69c4cbf3:

    # k "Sir?"
    k "先生？"

# game/script.rpy:2982
translate schinese intro_start_254fb662:

    # k "Do you need help?"
    k "需要帮忙吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2983
translate schinese intro_start_30d1b1d0:

    # k "... Mr. [mc]?"
    k "……[mc]先生？"

# game/script.rpy:2985
translate schinese intro_start_c4d56891:

    # mc "... Uhm. Yeah, give me a hand here."
    mc "……呃，来搭把手。"

# game/script.rpy:2986
translate schinese intro_start_0a0ab5b5:

    # k "Certainly."
    k "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:2991
translate schinese intro_start_0908849d:

    # k "This is the Academy Report Screen. And the first of its pages." with d
    k "这是学院报告界面，也是它的第一页。" with d

# game/script.rpy:2992
translate schinese intro_start_9342a63d:

    # k "It is the initial page you'll see every time you open the book."
    k "这是你每次打开这本书都会看到的初始页面。"

# game/script.rpy:2993
translate schinese intro_start_c644d802:

    # k "It contains most of the initial reports related to the Board."
    k "上面有大部分与董事会相关的初始报告。"

# game/script.rpy:2995
translate schinese intro_start_c930e1a0:

    # k "As you can see over here, we have the {b}Board Requests{/b}."
    k "如你所见，这里是{b}董事会要求{/b}。"

# game/script.rpy:2996
translate schinese intro_start_a9622f5e:

    # k "These are your \"Main Objectives\", in a way."
    k "某种意义上说，这些就是你的「主要目标」。"

# game/script.rpy:2997
translate schinese intro_start_2635d9b7:

    # k "Most of the time, they will be vague and expecting you to reach a goal within a certain time frame."
    k "大多数时候，它们都很含糊，只要求你在某个时间范围内达成一个目标。"

# game/script.rpy:2998
translate schinese intro_start_f4d51d60:

    # k "I will also be attaching some extra information on every request the Board makes, so you can better understand what exactly needs to be done and when."
    k "董事会每提出一项要求，我都会附上一些额外信息，好让你更清楚地理解具体要做什么、什么时候做。"

# game/script.rpy:3000
translate schinese intro_start_946d8d30:

    # k "Below it, I'll write a small summary of your recent performance, based on the Board's observations."
    k "在它下面，我会根据董事会的观察，写一份你近期表现的简要总结。"

# game/script.rpy:3002
translate schinese intro_start_85fdd222:

    # k "Over here, I'll arrange a list of the so-called \"Bounties\"."
    k "在这边，我会整理一份所谓的「悬赏」清单。"

# game/script.rpy:3003
translate schinese intro_start_17d13d02:

    # k "These are mostly requested by our viewers that have made the biggest donations."
    k "这些大多是我们捐款最多的观众提出的要求。"

# game/script.rpy:3004
translate schinese intro_start_b898b7e8:

    # k "And since the Board expects you to satisfy them, you would benefit greatly in trying to perform these tasks."
    k "既然董事会期待你去满足它们，那么努力完成这些任务会对你大有好处。"

# game/script.rpy:3005
translate schinese intro_start_3ecf55c7:

    # k "They are not obligatory, however, so you can decide not to do so, but always at the cost of viewership."
    k "不过它们并非强制性的，你可以选择不做，但代价总是收视率。"

# game/script.rpy:3006
translate schinese intro_start_b9170f78:

    # k "They also tend to be more specific requests, often connected to certain acts and some subjects that the viewers are interested in."
    k "它们通常也更加具体，往往与观众感兴趣的某些行为和某些对象有关。"

# game/script.rpy:3008
translate schinese intro_start_89d92124:

    # k "And that's the first page..."
    k "以上就是第一页……"

# game/script.rpy:3016
translate schinese intro_start_5b53bc2a:

    # k "As for our second page.{w} It will be all about actually managing the Academy."
    k "至于第二页。{w}它讲的是如何真正管理这所学院。"

# game/script.rpy:3017
translate schinese intro_start_5c0363a1:

    # k "It will give you the opportunity to determine how the Academy approaches various aspects."
    k "它会让你有机会决定学院如何应对各个方面。"

# game/script.rpy:3021
translate schinese intro_start_61119cc8:

    # k "You will be able to choose the difficulty of our weekly tests."
    k "你可以选择我们每周测验的难度。"

# game/script.rpy:3025
translate schinese intro_start_e9381676:

    # k "As well as define how our teachers focus their approach towards our students."
    k "也可以定义我们的教师在面对学生时采取怎样的教学重点。"

# game/script.rpy:3029
translate schinese intro_start_9ae46fd4:

    # k "And, furthermore, decide how we punish students that do not comply with our behavior system."
    k "以及，进一步决定我们如何惩罚不遵守行为规范的学生。"

# game/script.rpy:3033
translate schinese intro_start_5a61a853:

    # k "As with many things, over the course of your stay here, these will change and evolve and provide you with different alternatives in how to apply these methods."
    k "和很多事情一样，随着你在这里待得越久，这些内容也会变化和演进，为你提供不同的执行方式。"

# game/script.rpy:3034
translate schinese intro_start_557d2297:

    # k "So the choices you are seeing right now will not be all there are, only what is available now."
    k "所以你现在看到的选项并不是全部，只是目前可选的那些。"

# game/script.rpy:3035
translate schinese intro_start_ece10eca:

    # k "And that was our second page, about managing the Academy."
    k "第二页就讲到这里，关于管理学院的说明。"

# game/script.rpy:3048
translate schinese intro_start_c2293236:

    # k "This is the third page. It will give you information about our Staff Members and Teachers." with d
    k "这是第三页。它会给你关于我们教职员工和教师的信息。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3052
translate schinese intro_start_3ae6103d:

    # mc "Wait... That's me!"
    mc "等等……那是我！"

# game/script.rpy:3053
translate schinese intro_start_201f4a41:

    # mc "But I don't seem to have a picture in there yet."
    mc "但我在上面好像还没有照片。"

# game/script.rpy:3057
translate schinese intro_start_79047db8:

    # k "Yes, as our Chief Academic Officer, you will be present in our Staff Member list."
    k "是的，作为首席学术官，你会被列入我们的教职员工名单。"

# game/script.rpy:3063
translate schinese intro_start_cec7f8f2:

    # k "As for your picture, we have a photographer on our Academy grounds today. He will take your picture for the Academy Report Book." with d
    k "至于你的照片，今天学院里有一位摄影师。他会为你拍一张照，放进学院报告册。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3069
translate schinese intro_start_dc9b27c9:

    # k "In any occasion, as you can see, we're severely understaffed." with d
    k "无论如何，如你所见，我们的人手严重不足。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3070
translate schinese intro_start_f878e9d4:

    # k "The Academy President has instructed me to guide you through this early period, as you will also be interviewing and making decisions about some potential hires."
    k "学院理事长指示我在这段初期指导你，因为你同时还要面试一些人，并对一些可能的雇用作出决定。"

# game/script.rpy:3071
translate schinese intro_start_ccb68932:

    # k "But that is something that will come in the later days."
    k "但那是以后几天的事了。"

# game/script.rpy:3072
translate schinese intro_start_1fe4b912:

    # k "So, for the moment, that's the third page."
    k "所以，目前就说到这里，这是第三页。"

# game/script.rpy:3082
translate schinese intro_start_41770733:

    # k "And finally..." with dd
    k "最后……" with dd

# game/script.rpy:3083
translate schinese intro_start_472f343b:

    # k "The main focus of our project... our students."
    k "我们项目的主要焦点……我们的学生。"

# game/script.rpy:3089
translate schinese intro_start_cefb89e0:

    # k "As you are well aware at this point, everything in this Academy exists in order to make these students perform for our project." with d
    k "你现在应该很清楚了，学院里的所有一切，都是为了让学生们为我们的项目献上表演。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3090
translate schinese intro_start_bcdfcbb9:

    # k "So, as you can imagine, they are vital to your job."
    k "所以，你可以想象，她们对你的工作至关重要。"

# game/script.rpy:3091
translate schinese intro_start_426367dc:

    # k "Therefore, you will need to know them, and understand how they operate and behave, as well as their unique personalities."
    k "因此，你需要了解她们，理解她们的运作方式和行为，以及她们各自独特的性格。"

# game/script.rpy:3097
translate schinese intro_start_2bf65386:

    # k "Like the Academy President said in your interview, all of these students have failed their education early in their lives and they were handpicked to be a part of this project." with d
    k "就像学院理事长在你面试时说的，这些学生全都在人生早期就学业失败，她们是被精心挑选出来成为这个项目一员的。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3098
translate schinese intro_start_803c2411:

    # k "And as you can imagine, the reason they were selected was because they fit the profile of the type of students that would be more likely to engage in the activities we expect them to participate in."
    k "而你可以想象，她们被选中的原因，是因为她们符合那类学生的画像——也就是更有可能参与我们期望她们参加的活动的人。"

# game/script.rpy:3104
translate schinese intro_start_aebd8390:

    # k "With that being said... I'm sure you have noticed a different part of this section. Our 'Main Target' Students..." with d
    k "话虽如此……我想你已经注意到这一部分里有个不一样的地方了。我们的「主要目标」学生……"with d

# game/script.rpy:3105
translate schinese intro_start_70e88ccd:

    # k "That is something that was not discussed during our initial interview, as you are to learn about that now."
    k "这在最初的面试里没有讨论过，而你现在要开始了解了。"

# game/script.rpy:3111
translate schinese intro_start_2589c7e4:

    # k "These are 3 students that are very valuable to us." with d
    k "这是三位对我们非常有价值的学生。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3112
translate schinese intro_start_1ca24968:

    # k "And they are also the main reason as to why you were chosen as the Chief Academic Officer."
    k "她们也是你被选为首席学术官的主要原因。"

# game/script.rpy:3113
translate schinese intro_start_b4b2d875:

    # k "That is because the Academy President believed that you would be the perfect person to make these students fit into our mold."
    k "因为学院理事长相信，你会是最适合把这些学生塑造成我们模子里的形状的人。"

# game/script.rpy:3114
translate schinese intro_start_d3fe824c:

    # k "For various reasons, these three have piqued the interest of the Board, and they expect that you will be able to turn them toward degeneracy and corrupt their desires."
    k "出于各种原因，这三个人引起了董事会的兴趣，他们期待你能把她们引向堕落，并腐化她们的欲望。"

# game/script.rpy:3115
translate schinese intro_start_c6a6e0bc:

    # k "Therefore, focusing your efforts on them might be a good idea."
    k "因此，把精力集中在她们身上，或许是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:3116
translate schinese intro_start_9e4e4c07:

    # k "As for who exactly these three are..."
    k "至于这三位究竟是谁……"

# game/script.rpy:3120
translate schinese intro_start_9a4d0c5b:

    # k "We'll begin with this one..."
    k "我们从这一位开始……"

# game/script.rpy:3121
translate schinese intro_start_480bb1c0:

    # k "[maiya.surname], [maiya.name]."
    k "[maiya.surname],[maiya.name]。"

# game/script.rpy:3127
translate schinese maiya_intro_d49ee78d:

    # k "You will quickly notice that [maiya.name] is among our most {i}popular{/i} students." with d
    k "你很快就会注意到，[maiya.name]是我们最{i}受欢迎{/i}的学生之一。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3128
translate schinese maiya_intro_eedd5387:

    # k "She tends to be around those who are at the top of the social hierarchy of our Academy, and you could say she enjoys the status that comes with it."
    k "她往往出现在我们学院社会阶层的顶层人士身边，可以说她很享受随之而来的地位。"

# game/script.rpy:3129
translate schinese maiya_intro_478c6ff5:

    # k "Therefore, she was quick to make connections with some of our other student groups that fit said social standards she looks for."
    k "因此，她很快就和我们其他一些符合她所追求的社会标准的学生群体搭上了关系。"

# game/script.rpy:3130
translate schinese maiya_intro_ef5bff68:

    # k "There's also some increased level of promiscuity with Miss [maiya.name] and others from the aforementioned groups."
    k "在[maiya.name]小姐和上述群体中的其他人之间，还有一层更浓的关系网。"

# game/script.rpy:3131
translate schinese maiya_intro_cf11f3dd:

    # k "And as you would expect, this fits very well into our intentions for our {i}Academic Objectives{/i}."
    k "而正如你所料，这非常契合我们对{i}学业目标{/i}的意图。"

# game/script.rpy:3132
translate schinese maiya_intro_48758add:

    # k "But, I will say that there's some reluctancy from [maiya.name] to engage in these promiscuous activities. Almost as if she's keeping appearances, only out of peer pressure."
    k "不过我要说的是，[maiya.name]对于参与这些淫乱活动有些抗拒。简直就像是在维持表面形象，只是迫于同辈压力。"

# game/script.rpy:3133
translate schinese maiya_intro_61b2a0fa:

    # k "That, on its own, would be enough for her to be recruited as a student to our Academy."
    k "单凭这一点，就足以让她被招入我们学院了。"

# game/script.rpy:3134
translate schinese maiya_intro_2519967f:

    # k "But that brings the interesting question of why [maiya.name] would be chosen as one of our main targets..."
    k "但这就引出了一个有趣的问题：为什么[maiya.name]会被选为我们的主要目标之一……"

# game/script.rpy:3135
translate schinese maiya_intro_d42f7f3d:

    # k "You will quickly notice that most of our main targets have a group of investors behind them that want to see you succeed in corrupting them specifically."
    k "你很快就会注意到，我们大多数主要目标背后都有一群投资者，他们想看到你成功地把她们腐化。"

# game/script.rpy:3136
translate schinese maiya_intro_1d9cf032:

    # k "Either because of them being in the eyes of the public for a while, or for other interesting reasons..."
    k "要么是因为她们有一段时间处在公众视野中，要么是出于其他有趣的原因……"

# game/script.rpy:3137
translate schinese maiya_intro_d6f434af:

    # k "However, with [maiya.name], there's something different."
    k "不过，[maiya.name]这里有点不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:3138
translate schinese maiya_intro_2701a26e:

    # k "It seems that only one very important investor and viewer has requested that she be one of our main targets."
    k "似乎只有一位非常重要的投资者兼观众，要求把她列为我们主要目标之一。"

# game/script.rpy:3139
translate schinese maiya_intro_49ec07f7:

    # k "So that viewer must have some sort of personal desire in seeing her in our {i}Academic Programs{/i}."
    k "那么那位观众一定是出于某种个人欲望，想在我们的{i}课程项目{/i}里看到她们。"

# game/script.rpy:3140
translate schinese maiya_intro_8789c7a3:

    # k "Which is somewhat curious indeed..."
    k "这确实有点耐人寻味……"

# game/script.rpy:3141
translate schinese maiya_intro_5af49b2d:

    # mc "So, there's one guy paying a lot of money to see [maiya.name], specifically?"
    mc "所以，有一个男人花了大价钱，专门点名要看[maiya.name]？"

# game/script.rpy:3142
translate schinese maiya_intro_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/script.rpy:3143
translate schinese maiya_intro_ac2395da:

    # mc "That guy must be very rich then..."
    mc "那家伙一定非常有钱……"

# game/script.rpy:3145
translate schinese maiya_intro_d95633e8:

    # k "But I digress...{w} We are not here to investigate our viewers private affairs or monetary capabilities." with d
    k "不过我说岔了……{w}我们并不是来调查观众的私人事务或者经济能力的。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3146
translate schinese maiya_intro_ec333f4f:

    # k "Your job is clear, and since she qualifies as one of our main targets, you should focus your efforts on her..."
    k "你的工作很清楚，既然她符合我们主要目标的条件，你就该把精力集中在她身上……"

# game/script.rpy:3147
translate schinese maiya_intro_8e359492:

    # mc "Fine."
    mc "好。"

# game/script.rpy:3154
translate schinese maiya_intro_b0603920:

    # k "And that was [maiya.surname], [maiya.name]." with d
    k "以上就是[maiya.surname]，[maiya.name]。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3161
translate schinese maiya_intro_86bb244f:

    # k "Now... Onto our next main target." with d
    k "那么……接下来是下一个主要目标。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3162
translate schinese maiya_intro_e7a2e34c:

    # k "[haruka.surname], [ha]."
    k "[haruka.surname],[ha]。"

# game/script.rpy:3167
translate schinese haruka_intro_5ad6e1af:

    # k "[ha] used to be a very popular Internet celebrity, with a big following and an ever rising popularity." with d
    k "[ha]曾经是相当红的网络红人，粉丝众多，人气一路飙升。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3168
translate schinese haruka_intro_1c57d6d1:

    # k "However, due to some unfortunate circumstances, she found her fan base dwindling."
    k "然而，由于一些不幸的变故，她的粉丝群开始萎缩。"

# game/script.rpy:3169
translate schinese haruka_intro_95f8cec0:

    # k "These unfortunate circumstances were brought upon her by her own manager."
    k "而这些不幸的变故，正是她自己的经纪人带来的。"

# game/script.rpy:3170
translate schinese haruka_intro_afaa3a2e:

    # k "It would seem that she and this manager of hers had a somewhat close relationship."
    k "看来她和这位经纪人之间的关系曾相当亲密。"

# game/script.rpy:3171
translate schinese haruka_intro_e8e0dca4:

    # k "But then, after some disagreements, some private things were leaked and that caused her fans to doubt her true nature."
    k "但后来，两人之间发生了一些分歧，一些私人的东西被泄露出去，粉丝们因此开始怀疑她的本性。"

# game/script.rpy:3172
translate schinese haruka_intro_4da8f235:

    # mc "Private things being leaked, huh...?"
    mc "私人东西被泄露，嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:3173
translate schinese haruka_intro_76c82ea8:

    # mc "Like nudes and stuff like that?"
    mc "是裸照之类的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3174
translate schinese haruka_intro_3de13eea:

    # k "... Mostly conversations and accusations."
    k "……主要是聊天记录和指控。"

# game/script.rpy:3175
translate schinese haruka_intro_dc08d9d0:

    # k "And because of that, her popularity went in a downward spiral and she probably felt like too much effort was needed to regain her status."
    k "于是她的人气一路直线下滑，而她大概也觉得要恢复地位太费劲了。"

# game/script.rpy:3176
translate schinese haruka_intro_c02c39f9:

    # k "So she never tried."
    k "所以她从来没有尝试过。"

# game/script.rpy:3177
translate schinese haruka_intro_07658183:

    # k "As you can imagine, [ha] dropped her education midway through her early years due to her newfound fame at the time."
    k "你可以想象，[ha]因为当时初尝成名，学业在早期就被中途放弃了。"

# game/script.rpy:3178
translate schinese haruka_intro_9bbf63b2:

    # k "And now, seeing as she would most likely return to a normal life, we offered her a place in our Academy."
    k "如今，考虑到她很可能要回归正常生活，我们向她提供了学院的一个名额。"

# game/script.rpy:3179
translate schinese haruka_intro_178dc16d:

    # k "Logically, many of our viewers already know about her, so she will probably be a favorite pick among the majority."
    k "从逻辑上说，我们的很多观众已经知道她了，所以她多半会成为热门人选。"

# game/script.rpy:3180
translate schinese haruka_intro_11e9d12a:

    # k "Which explains why she's a main target."
    k "这也是她成为主要目标的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:3181
translate schinese haruka_intro_7054bdfa:

    # mc "I see... Interesting."
    mc "我明白了……有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:3189
translate schinese haruka_intro_aee60f14:

    # k "And that's it about [ha]." with d
    k "关于[ha]就说到这里。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3193
translate schinese haruka_intro_df8516cc:

    # k "Which leaves us only with our last, but not least..."
    k "这样就只剩下我们最后一位，也是同样重要的一位了……"

# game/script.rpy:3194
translate schinese haruka_intro_db50b0aa:

    # k "[ayumi.surname], [ayumi.name]." with d
    k "[ayumi.surname],[ayumi.name]。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3199
translate schinese ayumi_intro_537560e1:

    # mc "Oh, that one... That's the girl you were talking with at the entrance, right?" with d
    mc "哦，那位啊……就是你在门口搭话的女孩，没错吧？" with d

# game/script.rpy:3200
translate schinese ayumi_intro_f3eb4977:

    # k "Correct. And as you could gather from our brief exchange, she will be quite a challenge..."
    k "没错。而且从我们刚才那点简短的交流你应该能看出来，她会是个相当棘手的对手……"

# game/script.rpy:3201
translate schinese ayumi_intro_305e5c06:

    # k "[ayumi.surname] [ayumi.name] comes from a rich family and has had a very privileged past where she was always given the best there is in every aspect."
    k "[ayumi.surname][ayumi.name]出身富裕家庭，过去一直过着非常优渥的生活，各个方面都享有最好的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:3202
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a4cdff20:

    # k "However, as her parents offered her the best, they also demanded excellence on her part."
    k "不过，父母给了她最好的，同时也要求她做到卓越。"

# game/script.rpy:3203
translate schinese ayumi_intro_fbf9b49e:

    # k "As a result, she used to attend a highly prestigious school, with very strict methods and hard exams."
    k "结果就是，她上的是一所名誉极高的学校，那里的教学方式非常严格，考试也很难。"

# game/script.rpy:3204
translate schinese ayumi_intro_09c86a47:

    # k "But, that would never pose a challenge to Ms. [ayumi.surname], where she would excel in her studies, and always managed to be top of her class."
    k "但这对[ayumi.surname]小姐来说从来不算挑战，她成绩优异，总能拿到班级第一。"

# game/script.rpy:3205
translate schinese ayumi_intro_0cb5f37c:

    # k "And that brings us to the puzzling question of why she finds herself in our Academy."
    k "这就引出了一个令人费解的问题：她为什么会进到我们学院来。"

# game/script.rpy:3206
translate schinese ayumi_intro_22fc4992:

    # mc "Uh... Yeah. Did she not finish school?"
    mc "呃……是啊。她没读完书吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3207
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a9b96c53:

    # k "It would seem that the pressure that her parents put on her only made her wish for a way out of that lifestyle."
    k "看来，父母施加给她的压力，只是让她渴望能摆脱那种生活。"

# game/script.rpy:3208
translate schinese ayumi_intro_112071af:

    # k "As our initial report suggests, she left her parents' house after a big disagreement with her father and abandoned school to live with a friend."
    k "正如我们最初的报告所说，她和父亲大吵一架后离家出走，放弃学业，搬去和一个朋友同住。"

# game/script.rpy:3209
translate schinese ayumi_intro_11774fdb:

    # k "The specifics of this disagreement is not quite clear yet."
    k "这次争执的具体细节目前还不太清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:3210
translate schinese ayumi_intro_81e50913:

    # k "Nevertheless, it would seem that [ayumi.name] would now find herself living away from her parents and with no way to resume her studies."
    k "尽管如此，看来[ayumi.name]现在正远离父母生活，又没有任何继续学业的办法。"

# game/script.rpy:3211
translate schinese ayumi_intro_b29310af:

    # k "And that's why our Academy offered her a place here, so she could finish her education."
    k "所以我们的学院才给了她一个名额，让她可以完成学业。"

# game/script.rpy:3212
translate schinese ayumi_intro_89c7fece:

    # k "But, as you can imagine, finding a way to make [ayumi.name] submit to our methods might be somewhat difficult, seeing as she'll most likely always outscore her peers in any exam."
    k "但正如你所想，要找到让[ayumi.name]屈服于我们手段的方法，可能会相当困难，因为她在任何考试中大概率都会超过同侪。"

# game/script.rpy:3214
translate schinese ayumi_intro_df1fa37f:

    # mc "... Okay. So, let me see if I got this straight." with d
    mc "……好。那么，让我确认一下我理解得对不对。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3215
translate schinese ayumi_intro_ef1df3c5:

    # mc "... So far, we've had that girl, [maiya.name], who is basically a main target because one of our viewers is really obsessed with her, right?"
    mc "……到目前为止，有个叫[maiya.name]的女孩基本上成为主要目标，是因为我们有个观众对她特别着迷，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3216
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a0147530:

    # k "... Yes."
    k "……对。"

# game/script.rpy:3217
translate schinese ayumi_intro_f8b39cbf:

    # mc "And the other one, [ha]. She was quite famous, so there must be a lot of people among our viewers who wish to see her in our... {i}Academic Programs{/i}...?"
    mc "还有另一位，[ha]。她当时相当有名，所以我们的观众里肯定有很多人想看她在我们的……{i}课程项目{/i}里表演……？"

# game/script.rpy:3218
translate schinese ayumi_intro_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:3219
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a34faa2a:

    # mc "Then why is there such a big interest in [ay]?"
    mc "那为什么大家会对[ay]有这么大的兴趣呢？"

# game/script.rpy:3220
translate schinese ayumi_intro_9574e20c:

    # mc "Her parents are rich, but other than that, she's just an ordinary girl, right?"
    mc "她父母是很有钱，但除此之外，她就是个普通女孩，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3221
translate schinese ayumi_intro_265a03ab:

    # k "... Not quite."
    k "……不太是。"

# game/script.rpy:3222
translate schinese ayumi_intro_2a1f758c:

    # k "I would say she is the one the Board has the greatest desire to see being corrupted."
    k "我得说，她是董事会最想看到被腐化的那一个。"

# game/script.rpy:3223
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a74515b8:

    # mc "Wow... And why is that?"
    mc "哇……为什么？"

# game/script.rpy:3224
translate schinese ayumi_intro_f3be3f4b:

    # k "You see... The head of the [ayumi.surname] Family, and also [ay]'s father, is a very well-known politician."
    k "你看……[ayumi.surname]家的家主，也就是[ay]的父亲，是一位非常知名的政治家。"

# game/script.rpy:3225
translate schinese ayumi_intro_9b8ec29b:

    # k "So there must be some interest in the Board in having some strings attached to him."
    k "所以董事会一定有兴趣在他身上牵些线。"

# game/script.rpy:3226
translate schinese ayumi_intro_3b0386d4:

    # k "That's why [ay] is a very valuable target."
    k "这就是[ay]成为非常有价值目标的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:3227
translate schinese ayumi_intro_417359ad:

    # mc "... Oh. That makes sense..."
    mc "……哦。这就说得通了……"

# game/script.rpy:3234
translate schinese ayumi_intro_d6563b46:

    # mc "Actually... I learn better with a {i}hands-on{/i} approach." with d
    mc "其实……我更适合{i}边做边学{/i}。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3238
translate schinese ayumi_intro_c17d8ab8:

    # k "If that was intended as an act of mockery, then I'm afraid it was a poor effort."
    k "如果那是在嘲讽我，那恐怕这嘲讽做得不怎么样。"

# game/script.rpy:3240
translate schinese ayumi_intro_f0e1357d:

    # mc "Not really... Let's get this started so I can see what it really is like, then I'll take some time to learn about the managing aspect of it..."
    mc "也不完全是……我们先开始吧，让我先看看实际是怎么样的，然后再花点时间学习管理方面的东西……"

# game/script.rpy:3242
translate schinese ayumi_intro_4a2b4ebc:

    # k "As you wish..."
    k "如您所愿……"

# game/script.rpy:3244
translate schinese ayumi_intro_bd04d327:

    # k "But before we begin, there is one major aspect of your job that wasn't mentioned yet."
    k "不过在我们开始之前，还有你这份工作里有一个重要方面没有提到。"

# game/script.rpy:3245
translate schinese ayumi_intro_155bb45b:

    # k "And that is our {b}Main Targets{/b}."
    k "那就是我们的{b}主要目标{/b}。"

# game/script.rpy:3247
translate schinese ayumi_intro_716b68c4:

    # mc "Main targets? As if I thought this job wouldn't get weirder..."
    mc "主要目标？我就知道这份工作不会变得更奇怪……"

# game/script.rpy:3248
translate schinese ayumi_intro_16ba2313:

    # mc "But, okay... What about these Main Targets?"
    mc "不过好吧……这些主要目标是怎么回事？"

# game/script.rpy:3250
translate schinese ayumi_intro_19688322:

    # k "Your job is to corrupt our students into performing for our cameras, as it was discussed before."
    k "你的工作，就像之前说过的那样，是把我们的学生腐化到愿意为我们的摄像机表演。"

# game/script.rpy:3251
translate schinese ayumi_intro_e50e1923:

    # k "However, there are three students that are more important than the others, for various reasons."
    k "但出于各种原因，有三名学生比其他人都更重要。"

# game/script.rpy:3252
translate schinese ayumi_intro_2b3ee646:

    # k "And it's vital that you focus much of your efforts into making these specific students fit into the mold our Academy wants them to fit in."
    k "而你必须把大量精力放在让这几个特定的学生符合我们学院想要的模子上。"

# game/script.rpy:3254
translate schinese ayumi_intro_e8250630:

    # mc "Fine... When do I get to meet them?"
    mc "好吧……我什么时候能见到她们？"

# game/script.rpy:3256
translate schinese ayumi_intro_da262e82:

    # k "Soon."
    k "很快。"

# game/script.rpy:3257
translate schinese ayumi_intro_0cc72348:

    # k "For now, I'll provide a brief explanation of them... It shouldn't take too long."
    k "现在我先简单介绍一下她们……应该不会花太久。"

# game/script.rpy:3258
translate schinese ayumi_intro_6383b755:

    # k "Let's start with [maiya.surname], [maiya.name]."
    k "我们从[maiya.surname]，[maiya.name]开始。"

# game/script.rpy:3263
translate schinese ayumi_intro_e20d2fe4:

    # k "And that was [maiya.surname] [maiya.name]." with d
    k "以上就是[maiya.surname][maiya.name]。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3267
translate schinese ayumi_intro_86bb244f:

    # k "Now... Onto our next main target." with d
    k "那么……接下来是下一个主要目标。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3268
translate schinese ayumi_intro_e7a2e34c:

    # k "[haruka.surname], [ha]."
    k "[haruka.surname],[ha]。"

# game/script.rpy:3274
translate schinese ayumi_intro_69000afa:

    # k "That's it about [ha]." with d
    k "关于[ha]就说到这里。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3275
translate schinese ayumi_intro_76447742:

    # k "Which leaves us only with our third and last target."
    k "这样就只剩下我们第三个，也是最后一个目标。"

# game/script.rpy:3279
translate schinese ayumi_intro_98339448:

    # k "[ayumi.surname], [ay]." with d
    k "[ayumi.surname],[ay]。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3284
translate schinese ayumi_intro_6c24dfaf:

    # k "That's all there is to say about our Main Targets." with d
    k "关于我们的主要目标，要说的就这些。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3285
translate schinese ayumi_intro_219e7123:

    # k "If you need further explanation about either this topic, or others, I'll gladly answer any questions that might arise."
    k "如果这个话题或其他任何话题你还想进一步了解，我都很乐意回答任何可能出现的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:3288
translate schinese ayumi_intro_93a9d8bb:

    # mct "...{w} (Damn... It feels like I'm in {i}waaay{/i} over my head here.)" with d
    mct "……{w}（可恶……感觉我在这里是彻底{i}超纲{/i}了。）" with d

# game/script.rpy:3290
translate schinese ayumi_intro_ff172505:

    # mc "There must be all sorts of stuff we don't know that's going on with this {i}'Board'{/i}..."
    mc "这个{i}『董事会』{/i}背后，肯定还有一堆我们不知道的事在进行着……"

# game/script.rpy:3291
translate schinese ayumi_intro_1ea0a20c:

    # mc "Well, that {i}I{/i} don't know, at least... I'm sure you and the Academy President probably know all about the lizard people that run our country by now..."
    mc "嗯，至少{i}我{/i}不知道。我敢说你和学院理事长现在大概已经很清楚那些统治我们国家的蜥蜴人了……"

# game/script.rpy:3295
translate schinese ayumi_intro_8446723b:

    # k "I don't think {i}lizard{/i} people are real." with d
    k "我不认为{i}蜥蜴{/i}人是真实存在的。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3299
translate schinese ayumi_intro_05e48445:

    # mc "..." with d
    mc "……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3301
translate schinese ayumi_intro_eb725204:

    # mc "Awfully suspicious of you to say that..."
    mc "这话从你嘴里说出来，可疑得很啊……"

# game/script.rpy:3303
translate schinese ayumi_intro_9bac069d:

    # k "Besides, I'm afraid I don't know any more than you do now."
    k "而且，恐怕我现在知道的也不比你多。"

# game/script.rpy:3304
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a271d271:

    # k "Since you're now our Chief Academic Officer and I am your assistant, you outrank me in our Project Hierarchy."
    k "既然你现在是我们的首席学术官，而我是你的助理，在我们的项目层级里你比我高。"

# game/script.rpy:3305
translate schinese ayumi_intro_453b050c:

    # k "Therefore, if the Board wishes to share vital information about them or the project, I'm sure they'll share it with you first."
    k "所以如果董事会想透露关于他们或项目的重要信息，我敢肯定他们会先告诉你。"

# game/script.rpy:3306
translate schinese ayumi_intro_23761343:

    # k "... As for the Academy President. It's probably safe to assume he knows many things we don't."
    k "……至于学院理事长。可以稳妥地假设，他知道很多我们不知道的事。"

# game/script.rpy:3308
translate schinese ayumi_intro_31223869:

    # k "But I digress...{w} It's not my place, nor yours, to speculate. We're merely required to perform our tasks."
    k "不过我说岔了……{w}揣测不是我的职责，也不是你的。我们只要完成自己的任务。"

# game/script.rpy:3310
translate schinese ayumi_intro_5e44a000:

    # mc "Right..."
    mc "好的……"

# game/script.rpy:3314
translate schinese ayumi_intro_70677690:

    # mc "So... that's it? We're finished here?" with d
    mc "那么……就这些？我们结束了？" with d

# game/script.rpy:3316
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a71c29a4:

    # k "Yes. If there are more topics that could come up in the following days, I'll share my reports on them as they appear."
    k "是的。如果之后几天还有别的话题出现，我会在出现时把相关报告分享给你。"

# game/script.rpy:3319
translate schinese ayumi_intro_1be5b368:

    # mc "Cool!{w} Let's get to work then!" with hpunch
    mc "太好了！{w}那就开始干活吧！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:3322
translate schinese ayumi_intro_05e48445_1:

    # mc "..." with d
    mc "……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3323
translate schinese ayumi_intro_3e0c0ef9:

    # mc ".."
    mc "…"

# game/script.rpy:3324
translate schinese ayumi_intro_c96642c6:

    # mc "."
    mc "。"

# game/script.rpy:3326
translate schinese ayumi_intro_3fffa6cc:

    # mc "... Where do I begin? Is there something the board wants?"
    mc "……我该从何下手？董事会有什么要求吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3327
translate schinese ayumi_intro_f99eb3dd:

    # mc "Or should we... uhm..."
    mc "还是说我们该……呃……"

# game/script.rpy:3329
translate schinese ayumi_intro_a64e6e7f:

    # k "Don't worry. Since it's your first day, nothing is required of you."
    k "别担心。今天是你第一天，不会要求你做任何事。"

# game/script.rpy:3331
translate schinese ayumi_intro_04be71a8:

    # k "I have, however, prepared a scripted 'tour' so that you get a first-hand impression of our facility, staff members, teachers, and students." with d
    k "不过，我准备了一份有脚本的「参观」，让你对我们的设施、教职员工、教师和学生有个第一手的印象。"with d

# game/script.rpy:3332
translate schinese ayumi_intro_81dd0878:

    # k "But that can wait..."
    k "但那可以之后再说……"

# game/script.rpy:3334
translate schinese ayumi_intro_d3f72fdd:

    # k "In the meantime, feel free to familiarize yourself with the Academy Report Book."
    k "在此期间，你可以随意熟悉一下学院报告册。"

# game/script.rpy:3335
translate schinese ayumi_intro_489e9e68:

    # k "You can freely explore its pages and make any change you want."
    k "你可以自由浏览它的各个页面，并做任何你想做的改动。"

# game/script.rpy:3336
translate schinese ayumi_intro_50f82831:

    # k "There's also another section of the Academy Report Book that expands on each of the students' profiles, so if you want to see some more specific information about them, you can do so."
    k "学院报告册里还有另一个板块，会详细展开每位学生的档案，所以如果你想看关于她们更具体的信息，也可以去看。"

# game/script.rpy:3338
translate schinese ayumi_intro_2fbd63f9:

    # k "When you're ready, you can talk to me and we can begin your first day."
    k "等你准备好了，可以来找我，我们就可以开始你的一天。"

# game/script.rpy:3340
translate schinese ayumi_intro_6bfaed0f:

    # mc "Oh... Alright, then..."
    mc "哦……那好吧……"

# game/script.rpy:3341
translate schinese ayumi_intro_f60091be:

    # mc "Thanks, [k]."
    mc "谢谢你，[k]。"

# game/script.rpy:3370
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_fc8010d2:

    # k "Mr. [mc]." with d
    k "[mc]先生。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3372
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_3f158054:

    # k "Make sure to take a look at our Academy Report Book."
    k "一定要去看看我们的学院报告册。"

# game/script.rpy:3373
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_7d8140fe:

    # k "Once you feel familiarized with its contents, we can begin our tour of the facilities."
    k "等你熟悉了其中的内容，我们就正式开始参观设施。"

# game/script.rpy:3374
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_12a3bc6a:

    # k "Otherwise, if you feel like we should begin it posthaste, then let me know."
    k "或者，如果你觉得应该抓紧时间开始，就告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:3377
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_b7f1db80:

    # k "We can begin our tour when you're ready."
    k "你准备好之后，我们就可以开始参观。"

# game/script.rpy:3384
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_9ce9b366:

    # mc "I need to ask a few questions first..." with d
    mc "我得先问几个问题……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3386
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_1d1b7d0e:

    # k "Certainly. What do you wish to know?"
    k "当然。您想知道什么？"

# game/script.rpy:3390
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_2865497a:

    # mc "Uhm... On second thought, I'll stay a while longer and see a few other things..." with d
    mc "呃……再想想，我还是再待一会儿，多看看别的东西吧……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3392
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_c1972e9e:

    # k "As you wish, sir."
    k "如您所愿，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:3393
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_29bc7fd1:

    # k "Come and talk to me once you're ready to begin your tour of the facilities."
    k "等你准备好开始参观设施时，来和我说一声。"

# game/script.rpy:3400
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_5ea05b52:

    # mc "Okay, [k]. I'm ready to begin this tour of yours." with d
    mc "好，[k]。我准备好开始你这场参观导览了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3402
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_c1972e9e_1:

    # k "As you wish, sir."
    k "如您所愿，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:3403
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_fe1c75e8:

    # k "Follow me."
    k "跟我来。"

# game/script.rpy:3408
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_b149be87:

    # mc "What are your plans for this 'tour' of yours?" with d
    mc "您这场「参观」有什么计划？"with d

# game/script.rpy:3410
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_8426f261:

    # k "First, we're going to one of the classes that should be ongoing at this very moment."
    k "首先，我们去一堂此刻应该正在上的课。"

# game/script.rpy:3411
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_6f1c88d8:

    # k "It's a P.E. class that we have on Monday mornings."
    k "那是我们周一上午的体育课。"

# game/script.rpy:3412
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_e528f168:

    # k "Going there will provide you with a good opportunity to meet some of the students."
    k "去那里能给你一个接触部分学生的绝佳机会。"

# game/script.rpy:3413
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_1ae673d6:

    # k "And perhaps offer you a chance to show something to our viewers."
    k "说不定还能让你有机会给我们的观众展示点什么。"

# game/script.rpy:3414
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_5724f13a:

    # k "Although, I remind you again that you're not required to do anything special on your first day."
    k "不过我再说一遍：你第一天不需要做任何特别的事。"

# game/script.rpy:3415
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_e310a9a4:

    # k "Afterwards, we'll have some downtime and I've decided that a walk around the School Grounds would be a good way to know your way around the place, so I'll be introducing various locations during that walk."
    k "之后我们会有一些空闲时间，我打算在校园里走一走，那是个熟悉环境的好办法，我会在这趟散步中介绍各个场所。"

# game/script.rpy:3416
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_96fb340a:

    # k "Surely we'll find some students who'll be curious about our new Chief Academic Officer."
    k "肯定会有些学生对我们新任的首席学术官感到好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:3418
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_56482ba5:

    # mc "You know you don't have to say my full title every time, right?"
    mc "你知道不用每次都把我的完整头衔喊出来吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3419
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_3f7bf3bb:

    # mc "Just calling me Principal will save you a lot of time, seeing as you're always busy..."
    mc "叫我「理事长」就行，能帮你省下不少时间，毕竟你总是很忙……"

# game/script.rpy:3421
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_90f1103d:

    # k "..." with d
    k "……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3423
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_dc9cc38e:

    # k "Continuing..."
    k "继续……"

# game/script.rpy:3424
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_2604dcd9:

    # mct "(Ignored...)"
    mct "（被无视了……）"

# game/script.rpy:3425
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_4962d562:

    # k "After that, we'll finally end the day by taking your profile picture for our records."
    k "之后，我们今天就以给你的档案拍张照作为收尾。"

# game/script.rpy:3426
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_9c672fdd:

    # k "Our photographer is on Academy grounds today, so now is a great opportunity for it."
    k "我们的摄影师今天就在学院里，现在正是好时机。"

# game/script.rpy:3428
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_0ed62af9:

    # mc "Oh, right..."
    mc "哦，对……"

# game/script.rpy:3429
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_a7a50d7c:

    # mc "Then I'll have my picture in that book, right?"
    mc "这样我的照片就会出现在那本书里了，没错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3431
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_8f5b3ada:

    # k "Correct. On the {i}Staff Members{/i} page."
    k "没错。在{i}教职员工{/i}那一页。"

# game/script.rpy:3432
translate schinese kiyomi_office_dialogue_8da289fd:

    # k "... Any more questions?"
    k "……还有问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3471
translate schinese gym_intro_923728f0:

    # mc "The Academy seems to be in full swing today." with d
    mc "学院今天看起来已经完全运转起来了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3472
translate schinese gym_intro_5d6007ef:

    # mc "How many days ago did the academic period begin?"
    mc "学期是几天前开始的？"

# game/script.rpy:3476
translate schinese gym_intro_470bacbb:

    # k "We've already had a couple of weeks of activity, however, it was only a settling-in period for many of our students and teachers."
    k "我们已经活动了两周左右，不过那对很多学生和老师来说只是适应期。"

# game/script.rpy:3477
translate schinese gym_intro_c0466566:

    # k "The only thing we've done during this time was interviewing many of our students and conducting an intelligence evaluation."
    k "在这段时间里，我们做的唯一的事就是面试许多学生，并进行智力评估。"

# game/script.rpy:3478
translate schinese gym_intro_a68daf20:

    # k "And, of course, instructed our teachers on how our Academy will operate."
    k "当然，还向我们的老师说明了学院的运作方式。"

# game/script.rpy:3479
translate schinese gym_intro_180bd80f:

    # k "So the fundamental groundwork has already been prepared for you."
    k "所以最基本的前期准备已经为你做好了。"

# game/script.rpy:3482
translate schinese gym_intro_5d0078ae:

    # mc "Right... So, classes are ready to start." with d
    mc "好的……那么，课程可以开始了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3483
translate schinese gym_intro_3ed86779:

    # mc "And, an 'intelligence evaluation'? How does that work?"
    mc "还有，「智力评估」？那是怎么进行的？"

# game/script.rpy:3484
translate schinese gym_intro_6acabe4a:

    # k "It's a series of logical tests as well as some knowledge questions about topics the students would have been familiar with during their school years."
    k "那是一系列逻辑测试，外加一些关于学生在校期间应当熟悉的题材的知识问答。"

# game/script.rpy:3485
translate schinese gym_intro_d5c59a0e:

    # k "The specifics of said exams are not important. They do, however, serve as a way for us to predict how a student will be performing during our weekly tests."
    k "这些考试的具体内容并不重要。但它们确实能帮助我们预测某个学生在每周测验中的表现。"

# game/script.rpy:3486
translate schinese gym_intro_4d5c79fc:

    # mc "Weekly tests... We have those over here, huh?"
    mc "每周测验……我们这边也有这东西，哈？"

# game/script.rpy:3487
translate schinese gym_intro_ada858ae:

    # mc "I'm sure the students {i}love{/i} them."
    mc "我敢说学生们{i}爱死了{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:3488
translate schinese gym_intro_a6b3d51f:

    # k "Yes, we do have those. And if a student performs well on these tests, they will get a higher weekly payment from the Academy."
    k "是的，我们确实有。而如果学生在这些测验中表现良好，就能从学院拿到更高的周薪。"

# game/script.rpy:3489
translate schinese gym_intro_2456f62e:

    # mc "Oh... They get paid?"
    mc "哦……她们能拿钱？"

# game/script.rpy:3490
translate schinese gym_intro_8eafc2fb:

    # k "Of course. Otherwise, many wouldn't even accept {i}'wasting their time'{/i} going back to school."
    k "当然。不然很多人根本不会接受{i}『回去上学是浪费时间』{/i}这种事。"

# game/script.rpy:3491
translate schinese gym_intro_fe6b5b2e:

    # k "And since the payment is based on their grades, it encourages a degree of competitiveness and a desire to attain higher results."
    k "而且由于报酬和成绩挂钩，这会激发出一定的竞争意识，以及取得更好成绩的欲望。"

# game/script.rpy:3492
translate schinese gym_intro_0aca197f:

    # mc "{xpr}*whispering*{/xpr} {size=-10}That's one way to manipulate them..."
    mc "{xpr}*低声* {size=-10}这也是操控她们的一种方法……{/xpr}"

# game/script.rpy:3493
translate schinese gym_intro_88ae75e6:

    # k "Of course."
    k "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:3496
translate schinese gym_intro_6166d960:

    # mc "And where are we going first on this {i}tour{/i} you have prepared?" with d
    mc "那么，这场你准备好的{i}参观{/i}第一站是哪里？" with d

# game/script.rpy:3500
translate schinese gym_intro_d885b967:

    # k "I have managed to tell some of our teachers and staff members about your arrival."
    k "我已经把你要来的消息告诉了部分老师和教职员工。"

# game/script.rpy:3501
translate schinese gym_intro_91c09f66:

    # k "However, with such short notice, your presence here may be a surprise to some."
    k "不过通知得这么突然，你出现在这里可能会让一些人吃惊。"

# game/script.rpy:3502
translate schinese gym_intro_08f25e98:

    # k "Nevertheless, we are going first to our P.E. class."
    k "尽管如此，我们第一站还是去体育课。"

# game/script.rpy:3506
translate schinese gym_intro_1f972953:

    # mc "P.E. class? Seems like it would be a low priority class for an Academy such as this."
    mc "体育课？对于这样一所学院来说，听起来像是低优先级的课程。"

# game/script.rpy:3507
translate schinese gym_intro_fcf3ec61:

    # mc "Do we even grade students on those?"
    mc "那种课我们甚至会评分吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3511
translate schinese gym_intro_2f723bb8:

    # k "You would be correct on such an academic view of the subject at hand."
    k "如果从学术角度看待这门课，你的说法是对的。"

# game/script.rpy:3512
translate schinese gym_intro_9dd81d90:

    # k "A P.E. class serves little utility in developing our students."
    k "体育课在培养我们学生方面几乎没什么用。"

# game/script.rpy:3513
translate schinese gym_intro_962f4062:

    # k "However, during the inception of the program, a P.E. class was a highly requested course that our Academy should have."
    k "不过在项目创立之初，体育课是学院开设呼声很高的课程。"

# game/script.rpy:3517
translate schinese gym_intro_80d4803a:

    # mc "Oh… Of course that's the reason."
    mc "哦……当然是为了这个原因。"

# game/script.rpy:3521
translate schinese gym_intro_0911e1d1:

    # k "Yes, there are many aspects of our Academy that exist solely for that purpose."
    k "是的，我们学院有很多方面单纯就是为了那个目的而存在的。"

# game/script.rpy:3525
translate schinese gym_intro_4b2ae043:

    # mc "That makes sense. But I don't think you would want the students to start asking questions."
    mc "说得通。但我觉得你不会希望学生们开始提出疑问。"

# game/script.rpy:3529
translate schinese gym_intro_6fb2b1a2:

    # k "You would be surprised at how compliant many of our students are. They seem not to ask too many specific questions and are just happy to get the income we offer."
    k "你会惊讶于我们很多学生有多顺从。她们似乎不会问太多太具体的问题，只要能拿到我们提供的收入就很高兴了。"

# game/script.rpy:3530
translate schinese gym_intro_35e5b256:

    # k "However, you would be correct in assessing that some students do ask some difficult-to-answer questions."
    k "不过你要是认为确实有些学生会问一些难以回答的问题，那也没错。"

# game/script.rpy:3531
translate schinese gym_intro_80e24ad2:

    # k "We have, so far, answered most of them in a delicate manner."
    k "到目前为止，大部分问题我们都用圆滑的方式应付过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:3535
translate schinese gym_intro_af07d3f2:

    # k "Furthermore, to answer the rest of your question..." with d
    k "另外，关于你剩下的问题……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3536
translate schinese gym_intro_0d1169cb:

    # k "Again, we {i}should{/i} end the day by taking your picture for our Academic Report Book."
    k "再说一次，我们{i}应该{/i}以给你的《学院报告册》拍张照来结束今天。"

# game/script.rpy:3537
translate schinese gym_intro_a4764da6:

    # k "The photographer will only arrive at the Academy later, but he will stay until classes are over, so I have scheduled with him at a later period."
    k "摄影师会晚些时候才到学院，但他会留到课程结束，所以我和他约在了后面的时段。"

# game/script.rpy:3538
translate schinese gym_intro_dfd6f041:

    # k "Over the course of our visit to the P.E. class and said encounter with the Photographer, we will be visiting many parts of the Academy Grounds and inspecting classes during their lectures."
    k "在参观体育课、以及和摄影师碰面这整段过程中，我们会走访校园的许多地方，并在授课期间查看各个班级。"

# game/script.rpy:3542
translate schinese gym_intro_9da2ba07:

    # mc "Seems good..."
    mc "听起来不错……"

# game/script.rpy:3545
translate schinese gym_intro_74506237:

    # mc "And, man... this place is big." with d
    mc "还有，天啊……这地方真大。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3546
translate schinese gym_intro_6d7b0078:

    # mc "But it seems we don't have many students yet, right?"
    mc "不过看起来我们学生还不多，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3547
translate schinese gym_intro_30bf0b26:

    # k "The... funding our Academy received {i}was{/i} quite large."
    k "我们学院得到的{i}那笔{/i}资助相当可观。"

# game/script.rpy:3548
translate schinese gym_intro_13865fb3:

    # k "So we were able to acquire this place that had a somewhat bigger area."
    k "所以我们才能拿下这个面积更大的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3549
translate schinese gym_intro_330f8348:

    # k "As to the quantity of our students, you would be correct."
    k "至于学生数量，你说得没错。"

# game/script.rpy:3550
translate schinese gym_intro_14f314c3:

    # k "Compared to a normal school of this size, we have fewer than normal students, and teachers as well."
    k "和同等规模的普通学校相比，我们的学生和老师都更少。"

# game/script.rpy:3551
translate schinese gym_intro_defd9502:

    # k "That is due to how selective and rigorous our recruitment process is."
    k "这是因为我们的招生流程非常挑剔而严格。"

# game/script.rpy:3552
translate schinese gym_intro_23527043:

    # k "There are many factors we take into consideration to decide who will attend our Academy."
    k "我们会把许多因素纳入考量，来决定谁能进入我们学院。"

# game/script.rpy:3553
translate schinese gym_intro_1889e5a3:

    # mc "Heh...{w} I assume one of these factors is how good-looking a girl has to be, right?"
    mc "呵……{w}我猜这些因素之一是女孩得有多漂亮，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3554
translate schinese gym_intro_07edadb8:

    # mc "A lot of the girls here are beautiful!"
    mc "这里很多女孩都很漂亮！"

# game/script.rpy:3555
translate schinese gym_intro_2f9072ae:

    # k "...{w} That would be one of said factors, yes."
    k "……{w}没错，那确实是其中一个因素。"

# game/script.rpy:3556
translate schinese gym_intro_96642bd4:

    # k "But we do also look into their background and how they would fit into our Academic Program."
    k "不过我们也会调查她们的背景，以及她们会如何融入我们的学业项目。"

# game/script.rpy:3557
translate schinese gym_intro_a5e3a9c3:

    # k "The Academic Program they think they're in, as well as the one they are actually in..."
    k "既包括她们以为自己身处的那套项目，也包括她们实际所在的这套……"

# game/script.rpy:3560
translate schinese gym_intro_f2d7eb2b:

    # k "I apologize for such a lengthy walk to our indoor gym facility." with d
    k "抱歉，带您走了这么长一段路才到室内体育馆。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3561
translate schinese gym_intro_fcc0a9a2:

    # k "It is, after all, the most remote place in our Academy."
    k "毕竟这里是我们学院最偏僻的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3562
translate schinese gym_intro_e42b1a13:

    # k "But, nonetheless, here we are."
    k "不过，总之，我们到了。"

# game/script.rpy:3563
translate schinese gym_intro_bf153b88:

    # k "There should be a class starting at this very moment."
    k "此刻应该正好有一节课在上。"

# game/script.rpy:3567
translate schinese gym_intro_8ff99ea7:

    # mc "Sounds good... Let's go."
    mc "听起来不错……走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3580
translate schinese gym_intro_d0f28904:

    # k "Here we are." with d
    k "我们到了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3583
translate schinese gym_intro_c90a3544:

    # mc "Woah..." with dd
    mc "哇……" with dd

# game/script.rpy:3585
translate schinese gym_intro_8ffaff6d:

    # mc "... I get it now." with d
    mc "……我明白了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:3586
translate schinese gym_intro_43d2a222:

    # mc "That's why a P.E. class was a top choice..."
    mc "难怪体育课是首选……"

# game/script.rpy:3587
translate schinese gym_intro_2b6e3d46:

    # mc "Oh... wow."
    mc "哦……哇。"

# game/script.rpy:3595
translate schinese gym_intro_9bf8b9bb:

    # mc "{i}Ehhh~~{/i}" with d
    mc "{i}呃～～{/i}" with d

# game/script.rpy:3597
translate schinese gym_intro_17b00d39:

    # mc "{i}Ohoho~{/i}"
    mc "{i}哦呵～{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3599
translate schinese gym_intro_23deb293:

    # mc "Wow..." with d
    mc "哇……" with d

# game/script.rpy:3601
translate schinese gym_intro_bffcc167:

    # "???" "{size=-10}Hey!" with d
    "???" "{size=-10}喂!" with d

# game/script.rpy:3602
translate schinese gym_intro_cf7e04c3:

    # "???" "{size=-10}Bro, wake up!"
    "???" "{size=-10}哥们儿,醒醒!"

# game/script.rpy:3606
translate schinese gym_intro_e9c57ad3:

    # v1 "Yo!" with hpunch
    v1 "喂！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:3607
translate schinese gym_intro_1ff5c1b7:

    # v1 "My man!" with d
    v1 "大哥！" with d

# game/script.rpy:3608
translate schinese gym_intro_4bdd5b77:

    # v1 "Get your head back in the game!!"
    v1 "打起精神来！！"

# game/script.rpy:3612
translate schinese gym_intro_d05beff5:

    # v1 "HAAHAH!!"
    v1 "哈哈！！"

# game/script.rpy:3614
translate schinese gym_intro_ab7bfb8b:

    # v1 "I assume you must be my new boss?"
    v1 "你就是我的新上司吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3616
translate schinese gym_intro_efc1b0b0:

    # mc "Uhh, yeah, that would be me... Sorry, I was a little distracted."
    mc "呃，是，就是我……抱歉，我刚才有点走神。"

# game/script.rpy:3617
translate schinese gym_intro_fee6d0f1:

    # mc "My name is [mc], pleasure to meet you..."
    mc "我叫[mc]，很高兴认识你……"

# game/script.rpy:3620
translate schinese gym_intro_c97c7775:

    # k "Sir, this is [mar], our P.E. teacher."
    k "先生，这位是[mar]，我们的体育老师。"

# game/script.rpy:3622
translate schinese gym_intro_64946380:

    # mc "Pleasure to meet you, [mar]."
    mc "很高兴认识你，[mar]。"

# game/script.rpy:3624
translate schinese gym_intro_204ef809:

    # mar "The pleasure is mine, Boss!"
    mar "该感到荣幸的是我，老板！"

# game/script.rpy:3626
translate schinese gym_intro_361a2be9:

    # mc "You're obviously not from here."
    mc "你一看就不是这儿的人。"

# game/script.rpy:3628
translate schinese gym_intro_811c6ba3:

    # mar "Hah!! Guess I don't blend in, huh?"
    mar "哈！！看来我格格不入，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3629
translate schinese gym_intro_da9d94ab:

    # mar "I'm from the US!"
    mar "我来自美国！"

# game/script.rpy:3630
translate schinese gym_intro_dc57d11f:

    # mar "And my full name is [marcus.name] [marcus.surname]."
    mar "我的全名是[marcus.name][marcus.surname]。"

# game/script.rpy:3631
translate schinese gym_intro_89f7fc6e:

    # mar "Do you recognize me now? Does the name ring a bell?"
    mar "现在认出来了吗？这名字你有印象吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3633
translate schinese gym_intro_fb5d4973:

    # mc "Uhm... Sorry, no it doesn't."
    mc "呃……抱歉，没印象。"

# game/script.rpy:3635
translate schinese gym_intro_e5d6b76c:

    # mar "{xpr}Bah...{/xpr} Guess the sport is not as famous here as it is back home..."
    mar "{xpr}啧……{/xpr}看来这项运动在这里没我老家那么有名……"

# game/script.rpy:3637
translate schinese gym_intro_f862cd37:

    # mar "I used to be a football star back in the day!" with hpunch
    mar "我以前可是足球明星！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:3638
translate schinese gym_intro_6cb0e367:

    # mc "Wow... A football star? So you were famous then?!"
    mc "哇……足球明星？那你当时很有名？！"

# game/script.rpy:3640
translate schinese gym_intro_ce6dc9e8:

    # mar "Uh... Yeah!! Very famous... But... Maybe that fame hasn't reached this part of the world yet..."
    mar "呃……对！！非常有名……不过……也许那名声还没传到世界这个角落来……"

# game/script.rpy:3641
translate schinese gym_intro_53de1079:

    # mar "But, to be honest, I prefer it that way!"
    mar "但说真的，我更喜欢这样！"

# game/script.rpy:3642
translate schinese gym_intro_2aca89c7:

    # mc "That's interesting... But how'd you end up as a teacher at ReLive Academy?"
    mc "有意思……不过你怎么会来 ReLive 学院当老师的？"

# game/script.rpy:3643
translate schinese gym_intro_b4c82ea8:

    # mar "Well, I... I retired! And then I wanted to do something related to my previous career."
    mar "这个嘛，我……我退役了！然后想做点跟以前职业相关的事。"

# game/script.rpy:3644
translate schinese gym_intro_c45f708b:

    # mar "So, P.E. teacher made sense!"
    mar "所以当体育老师很合理！"

# game/script.rpy:3646
translate schinese gym_intro_0ce72323:

    # mc "But you're very far away from home."
    mc "但你离家非常远。"

# game/script.rpy:3647
translate schinese gym_intro_716a12f1:

    # mc "It's quite unusual..."
    mc "确实挺不寻常的……"

# game/script.rpy:3649
translate schinese gym_intro_f6b3cc25:

    # mar "Heh... What can I say? I like to explore new things!"
    mar "呵……我能说什么呢？我喜欢尝试新事物！"

# game/script.rpy:3650
translate schinese gym_intro_0f240219:

    # mc "If you say so..."
    mc "既然你这么说……"

# game/script.rpy:3653
translate schinese gym_intro_47ab653f:

    # mar "... Anyway, let me introduce you to the girls!"
    mar "……总之，来给大家介绍一下吧！"

# game/script.rpy:3655
translate schinese gym_intro_873d0fae:

    # mar "Girls! Let's take a little break! I need to introduce someone!" with d
    mar "姑娘们！先暂停一下！我得介绍个人！" with d

# game/script.rpy:3656
translate schinese gym_intro_51823621:

    # mar "This here is our new Academy Principal! Mr. [mc]."
    mar "这位就是我们新任的学院理事长！[mc]先生。"

# game/script.rpy:3657
translate schinese gym_intro_a9b07a2f:

    # mar "Give him a hearty welcome!"
    mar "大家热情欢迎一下！"

# game/script.rpy:3659
translate schinese gym_intro_759ab556:

    # _("Girls") "Hi, Mr. [mc]!" with d
    _("女生们") "你好,[mc]先生!" with d

# game/script.rpy:3666
translate schinese gym_intro_8881f03f:

    # mc "Hello, girls!"
    mc "大家好，姑娘们。"

# game/script.rpy:3668
translate schinese gym_intro_bd529207:

    # mc "Is this an all-girls class?"
    mc "这是女子班吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3669
translate schinese gym_intro_dcc76059:

    # mar "Hah! I wish... But no... The reason I called in the girls today was because we might have a girls' soccer team."
    mar "哈！我也希望是……但不是。今天把姑娘们叫出来，是因为我们可能要组建一支女子足球社。"

