translate schinese gym_intro_6b785509:

    # mar "Since we have about 5 girls for every boy in this Academy, it wouldn't make sense for me to try for a male team also."
    mar "因为我们学院里男生女生大概是五比一，我要是同时去组男队就没道理了。"

# game/script.rpy:3671
