# game/script.rpy:3714
translate schinese gym_intro_450452c8:

    # k "My guess is that Mr. [mar] wasn't good enough for the main stage."
    k "我猜[mar]先生的水平不足以登上主流舞台吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3716
translate schinese gym_intro_3d7f6f95:

    # mc "But still. It's quite unusual for him to teach here."
    mc "不过话说回来，他居然来这里任教，还是相当不寻常。"

# game/script.rpy:3718
translate schinese gym_intro_42201e19:

    # k "Indeed. However, Mr. [mar] has a similar story to a lot of our staff members."
    k "确实。不过，[mar]先生的经历和我们很多教职员工类似。"

# game/script.rpy:3719
translate schinese gym_intro_96a6cbf3:

    # k "One night, he got excessively intoxicated at a night club. And the result was that one of the girls he was with accused him of sexual assault."
    k "一天晚上，他在夜店里喝得烂醉。结果，当时和他在一起的一个女孩指控他性侵。"

# game/script.rpy:3721
translate schinese gym_intro_3c170f59:

    # k "After that, he got suspended by the league and other women appeared with similar cases, with Mr. [mar] as the offender."
    k "之后他被联盟停赛，又有其他女性站出来指控，[mar]先生是加害者。"

# game/script.rpy:3722
translate schinese gym_intro_68e57ccc:

    # k "The Academy President, and the Board, agreed that Mr. [mar] would be a great candidate for our Academy. And a deal was offered to him."
    k "学院理事长和董事会一致认为，[mar]先生会是我们学院的一个绝佳人选。于是我们向他开出了条件。"

# game/script.rpy:3724
translate schinese gym_intro_b0fb860a:

    # k "He would come to Japan, learn the language, get a teaching certificate. All funded by our Board."
    k "他会来日本，学习语言，取得教师资格证。全部费用由董事会承担。"

# game/script.rpy:3725
translate schinese gym_intro_65273339:

    # k "After that, he would have a job at our Academy, and we would take care of his legal problems."
    k "作为交换，他会到我们学院任职，而他的法律问题由我们处理。"

# game/script.rpy:3727
translate schinese gym_intro_e71b27de:

    # mc "That explains a lot... I'm sure he couldn't refuse that deal."
    mc "这就解释了很多事……我敢肯定他没法拒绝。"

# game/script.rpy:3729
translate schinese gym_intro_a9a97563:

    # k "Yes... It is a similar situation to yours, Mr. [mc]."
