# game/script.rpy:3764
translate schinese gym_intro_4bb5c344:

    # k "Years later, we offered her a chance to be a part of our Academy and pay for her education. Seeing as her family is still struggling financially, she accepted the opportunity to join our Academic Program..."
    k "几年后，我们给了她一个加入我们学院、由我们承担她学杂费的机会。由于她家里现在依然拮据，她接受了这个加入我们学业项目的机会……"

# game/script.rpy:3765
translate schinese gym_intro_3a848640:

    # k "Due to the lack of knowledge on her, and her perceived purity, I suspect it might be difficult to persuade her into performing for our audience."
    k "由于对她了解不多，加上她看起来很纯真，我怀疑要说服她为我们的观众表演可能会很困难。"

# game/script.rpy:3766
