    # mar "Thanks for participating today! And I believe the girls liked you as well!"
    mar "谢谢你今天的参与！而且我相信姑娘们也都很喜欢你！"

# game/script.rpy:5248
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_d31d5a55:

    # mar "It looks like they're gossiping among themselves about you! Hah!"
    mar "看来她们正在互相八卦你呢！哈！"

# game/script.rpy:5250
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_c40945aa:

    # mc "Yeah, it was a nice session. We have got some interesting students here."
    mc "是啊，今天挺愉快的。我们这儿果然有些有意思的学生。"

# game/script.rpy:5252
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_2b1016e9:

    # mar "{i}Ohhh{/i} yeah... And you haven't seen half of them yet."
    mar "{i}哦呵{/i}是啊……而且你看到的还只是一半。"

# game/script.rpy:5253
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_e04898a6:

    # mar "Some good... Some bad."
    mar "有些很好……有些很糟。"

# game/script.rpy:5254
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_4f4b5a6b:

    # mar "Some really bad..."
    mar "有些真的很糟……"

# game/script.rpy:5256
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_9b0acb9c:

    # mar "Some {i}really{/i} good! Hehehe!"
    mar "有些{i}真的{/i}很好！呵呵呵！"

# game/script.rpy:5257
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_f4d7b872_1:

    # mc "... Right."
    mc "……是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:5259
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_5cae39c6:

    # mc "... Yeah. Anyway, I'll let you get back to your class now, I have some other things to take care of today."
    mc "……总之，我现在让你去继续上课吧，今天我还有些别的事要处理。"

# game/script.rpy:5261
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_7d3ff519:

    # mar "Before you go, there's one last thing I wanted to discuss with you, [mc]."
    mar "你去之前，还有最后一件事想和你谈，[mc]。"

# game/script.rpy:5263
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_f4cf77c4:

    # mc "Go ahead." with d
    mc "请说。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5265
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_b0ade8e2:

    # mar "Are you familiar with our \"{b}Strikes{/b}\" system?!" with hpunch
    mar "你熟悉我们的「{b}记过{/b}」制度吗？！"with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:5269
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_671e579d:

    # mc "Uh... No. But I'm sure I should've known this by now." with d
    mc "呃……不熟悉。不过我早该知道了。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5271
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_e85523f8:

    # mc "Hey, [k]! Can you refresh my memory?"
    mc "喂，[k]！能帮我回忆一下吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5272
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_0a0ab5b5:

    # k "Certainly."
    k "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:5274
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_43a3a410:

    # k "Our Strike system is our main form of correcting a student's behavior." with d
    k "我们的记过制度是矫正学生行为的主要手段。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5276
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_c8099e38:

    # k "The way it works is that, if a student misbehaves or when a staff member feels like it would be appropriate, they can issue a single \"Strike\" to that student."
    k "运作方式是：如果学生行为不当，或者教职员工觉得有必要，可以给学生一次「记过」。"

# game/script.rpy:5278
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_3605848e:

    # k "However, Teachers and Staff Members can only grant up to two strikes to a single student without having to consult with you, Mr. [mc]."
    k "不过，老师和教职员工在不必询问您的情况下，[mc]先生，最多只能给学生两次记过。"

# game/script.rpy:5280
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_fa52355a:

    # k "The third and final strike can only be given by you. The only thing that a Staff Member can do about the third strike is to send that student to your office and suggest the strike be given."
    k "第三次也是最后一次记过，只能由您来给。教职员工对第三次记过唯一能做的，就是把那学生带到您办公室，并建议给予记过。"

# game/script.rpy:5282
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_69cce5dc:

    # k "Therefore, the ultimate decision, of whether or not to give the third strike to a student, is always yours."
    k "所以，是否给学生第三次记过的最终决定权，永远在您手上。"

# game/script.rpy:5283
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_0b3c3811:

    # k "And the most likely scenario for the third strike's consequence is the expulsion of that student from our Academy."
    k "而第三次记过最可能带来的后果，就是把那学生从我们学院开除。"

# game/script.rpy:5285
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_effc610f:

    # k "Another thing to consider is that strikes can only be removed by you as well."
    k "还有一点要考虑，那就是记过也只能由您来撤销。"

# game/script.rpy:5286
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_6d22be24:

    # k "If you feel that it is appropriate, either because of the renewed trust in the student's behavior, or in return for a favor that benefitted the Academy, you could remove either a single strike or more from that student."
    k "如果您认为合适，无论是因为重新信任了该学生的表现，还是作为对学院有利的回报，你都可以撤销该学生的一次或多次记过。"

# game/script.rpy:5288
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_48bd2230:

    # mc "Ah. I see..."
    mc "啊。我明白了……"

# game/script.rpy:5290
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_f6d592cf:

    # mc "You could have just said it was a form of punishing students and I would get it."
    mc "你直接说这是惩罚学生的一种方式，我就能理解了。"

# game/script.rpy:5292
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_90f1103d:

    # k "..." with d
    k "……" with d

# game/script.rpy:5294
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_3847af67:

    # k "My apologies... Perhaps you can provide a more specific request next time, sir."
    k "很抱歉……也许下次您可以提更具体的要求，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:5296
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_1cf1171b:

    # mc "I'm just joking... Thanks, [k]."
    mc "我只是开玩笑……谢谢你，[k]。"

# game/script.rpy:5298
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_b8c6e795:

    # k "You're welcome."
    k "不客气。"

# game/script.rpy:5302
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_45562599:

    # mar "Ohh!!! Ms. [k] is quite smart, isn't she!?" with f
    mar "哦！！！[k]小姐挺聪明的嘛，对吧！？" with f

# game/script.rpy:5304
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_54cb3901:

    # mc "Hah... Yeah.{w} Sometimes I wonder if it isn't better to just let her run the Academy while I sit in my office, pretending to work..."
    mc "哈……是啊。{w}有时候我甚至在想，不如让她去管学院，我自己坐在办公室里假装工作……"

# game/script.rpy:5306
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_ae5cc17b:

    # mc "But anyway... The Strike System. What about it?"
    mc "不过话说回来……记过制度。它怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:5308
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_86b3325b:

    # mar "The reason I brought it up is because [ha] has been a little too rebellious in class..."
    mar "我提起它，是因为[ha]在课上有点太叛逆了……"

# game/script.rpy:5309
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_daafb459:

    # mar "She doesn't respect anyone, she picks fights left and right with the other girls, and she couldn't care less for my classes!"
    mar "她谁都不尊重，和其他女孩动辄就吵架，而且对我的课毫不在意！"

# game/script.rpy:5310
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_23bb2b67:

    # mar "All she does is sit in that corner reading or checking her phone."
    mar "她就只会坐在那个角落里看书或者看手机。"

# game/script.rpy:5313
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_ee64848c:

    # mar "And, you saw how she was laughing at [yo], right?"
    mar "而且，你看到她笑[yo]的样子了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5315
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_39869d29:

    # mar "And, you saw how she was talking to [ri], right?"
    mar "而且，你也看到她跟[ri]说话的样子了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5316
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_9f1c366e:

    # mar "She doesn't respect anyone!"
    mar "她谁都不尊重！"

# game/script.rpy:5318
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_85678f86:

    # mar "And I've been thinking on landing a strike on that bi-..."
    mar "我一直在考虑要不要给那个双性……"

# game/script.rpy:5320
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_6712d88f:

    # mar "On her... Landing a strike on her!"
    mar "给她……给那个女的记一次过！"

# game/script.rpy:5322
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_430f4dee:

    # mar "I could have done it already, but seeing as you were here today, and you saw her laughing at [yo]..."
    mar "我本来早就这么做了，但既然你今天正好在这儿，而且你也看到她笑[yo]了……"

# game/script.rpy:5324
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_6173f9f5:

    # mar "I could have done it already, but seeing as you were here today, and you saw her calling [ri] all sorts of stuff..."
    mar "我本来早就这么做了，但既然你今天正好在这儿，而且你也看到她骂[ri]那一堆话了……"

# game/script.rpy:5325
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_5abb7d7b:

    # mar "I thought it would be best to just discuss it with you."
    mar "我就觉得还是先跟你商量一下比较好。"

# game/script.rpy:5326
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_cb4d555a:

    # mar "So... Should I? Strike her for that?"
    mar "所以……要我这么做吗？因为那种事给她记过？"

# game/script.rpy:5334
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_948e0928:

    # mc "Sure, you can give her a Strike." with d
    mc "当然，你可以给她一次记过。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5336
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_555c4ad0:

    # mar "Hah!" with hpunch
    mar "哈！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:5337
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_a5845d90:

    # mar "Nice! Will do, Boss!"
    mar "太好了！就这么办，老板！"

# game/script.rpy:5343
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_006eaae6:

    # mc "I don't think it would be fair." with d
    mc "我觉得这样不太公平。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5345
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_3c604675:

    # mc "She just laughed at the situation, not at [yo]."
    mc "她只是在嘲笑那个场面，不是在嘲笑[yo]。"

# game/script.rpy:5347
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_05645ba2:

    # mc "They were both exchanging insults, and [ri] did try and get a reaction from her first."
    mc "而且她们本来就在互相骂，[ri]也确实先刺激了她，想看她反应。"

# game/script.rpy:5350
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_0439b50f:

    # mar "... You sure, Boss?" with d
    mar "……您确定吗，老板？" with d

# game/script.rpy:5351
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_4205315d:

    # mar "That girl is quite feisty."
    mar "那个女孩相当泼辣。"

# game/script.rpy:5352
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_d4dfdb17:

    # mar "I think it would be a good idea to start reeling her back a bit."
    mar "我觉得先敲打敲打她是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:5353
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_d1dbb376:

    # mar "But, you're still the Boss after all, right!? Haha!"
    mar "不过说到底，您还是老板，对吧！？哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:5354
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_d27df6ea:

    # mar "I won't strike her then... yet!"
    mar "那我就先不给她记过……暂时！"

# game/script.rpy:5360
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_14445edb:

    # mc "Hmm... I don't know." with d
    mc "嗯……我也说不好。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5362
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_9a450be9:

    # mc "[k]. What do you think about it?"
    mc "[k]，你怎么看？"

# game/script.rpy:5366
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_545257f4:

    # k "Yes." with dquick
    k "是。" with dquick

# game/script.rpy:5368
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_e2b9ad2c:

    # mc "...{w} Yes? That's it?"
    mc "……{w}是？就这样？"

# game/script.rpy:5370
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_70dc2532:

    # k "Should I elaborate this time, sir?"
    k "先生，这次需要我详细说明吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5372
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_e096284c:

    # mc "{xpr}*sigh*{/xpr} ... Yes, [k], please elaborate."
    mc "{xpr}*叹气*{/xpr}……是的，[k]，请详细说明。"

# game/script.rpy:5374
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_4a2b4ebc:

    # k "As you wish..."
    k "如您所愿……"

# game/script.rpy:5377
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_79d8c60b:

    # k "I believe it would be beneficial for our Academy to strike her." with d
    k "我认为给我们学院给她记过是有好处的。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5379
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_adfec54c:

    # k "[ha] has a sort of personality that would make her more prone to these situations..."
    k "[ha]的性格属于那种容易惹上这种麻烦的类型……"

# game/script.rpy:5380
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_0fd9ff27:

    # k "And I am sure she will find herself in trouble more often than not."
    k "而且我敢肯定，她惹上麻烦的次数会远多于其他情况。"

# game/script.rpy:5382
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_8fed18e5:

    # k "By giving her a strike, you could have a chance to call her to your office and talk things through. It could be an easy way of getting through to her."
    k "通过给她记过，你就有机会把她叫到办公室，把事情说开。这可能是一个让她听进去的轻松办法。"

# game/script.rpy:5384
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_78983ea7:

    # k "One key thing to remember is that \"Strikes\" don't necessarily have to be about punishing a student..."
    k "要记住的关键一点是：「记过」不一定非得是为了惩罚学生……"

# game/script.rpy:5385
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_921704b4:

    # k "They could also be about correcting some behaviors or having a chance to interact with the student in a more private environment."
    k "它也可以是为了纠正某些行为，或者制造一个在更私密环境里与该学生互动的机会。"

# game/script.rpy:5387
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_4b339705:

    # mc "Huh... So you think we should Strike her, so I could call her to my office and have a talk?"
    mc "嗯……所以你的意思是，我们应该给她记过，这样我就能把她叫到办公室谈一谈？"

# game/script.rpy:5389
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_51d7204f:

    # k "Correct. That would be the optimal choice."
    k "正确。那是最优化的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:5391
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_a7bcf340:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "我明白了……"

# game/script.rpy:5393
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_7eb2f1c5:

    # mar "... So?" with d
    mar "……那么？" with d

# game/script.rpy:5394
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_00511211:

    # mar "Should we strike her or not?"
    mar "我们到底要不要给她记过？"

# game/script.rpy:5397
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_9058a83c:

    # mc "Great... Is that all, then?" with d
    mc "好……就这些了吗？" with d

# game/script.rpy:5399
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_cbcf2923:

    # mar "Sure is, Boss!"
    mar "确实就这些，老板！"

# game/script.rpy:5400
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_e2abf544:

    # mar "Thanks again for coming to my class! Stop by anytime!"
    mar "再次感谢你来我的课！随时过来！"

# game/script.rpy:5404
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_b4d74782:

    # mar "And hey! Maybe you could do that again and help the girls out!"
    mar "还有，嘿！也许你可以再来一次，帮帮那些姑娘！"

# game/script.rpy:5406
translate schinese gym_intro_stretch_start_e46c3203:

    # mc "Yep, I'll drop by if I'm not busy. Bye [mar]."
    mc "好，只要不忙我就过去。再见，[mar]。"

# game/script.rpy:5436
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_d1b29c72:

    # v5 "Hey...{w} Boss." with d
    v5 "嘿……{w}老板。" with d

# game/script.rpy:5437
