translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_c7412fc5:

    # k "And his main role, apart from playing the part of a common 'Janitor', is to offer protection to our main targets and you."
    k "而他的主要职责，除了扮演一个普通「清洁工」之外，就是为我们的主要目标和你提供保护。"

# game/script.rpy:6456
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_06b42c2c:

    # mc "... I see. So I assume he knows our actual objective here."
    mc "……我明白了。所以我猜他知道我们真正的目标。"

# game/script.rpy:6458
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/script.rpy:6463
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_88cc9060:

    # k "Nevertheless, one thing you have to keep in mind is that although many of our students may look like regular students from your time in other schools, they're not."
    k "不过有一点你必须记住：虽然我们很多学生看起来和你在其他学校时见过的普通学生一样，但他们不是。"

# game/script.rpy:6464
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_c51ca1ce:

    # k "In regards to [sou]'s group, they're actual criminals. Some have already been convicted of crimes and arrested before."
    k "就[sou]那伙人而言，他们是真正的罪犯。其中有些人之前已经被判过刑、抓过。"

# game/script.rpy:6466
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_79dba188:

    # mc "Shit..."
    mc "靠……"

# game/script.rpy:6467
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_267c82a5:

    # mc "So I could've been stabbed or something?"
    mc "所以我刚才可能被人捅一刀？"

# game/script.rpy:6469
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_e16332d9:

    # k "It is not unlikely that one of them might've been carrying a sharp object. So, yes."
    k "他们当中有人带着利器并非没有可能。所以，是的。"

# game/script.rpy:6471
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_8b66e5c7:

    # mc "Well, next time, make sure to tell me these things up front then!"
    mc "那下次请一开始就把这些事告诉我！"

# game/script.rpy:6473
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_80f91ba3_1:

    # k "Of course, sir."
    k "当然，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:6478
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_d4a91f55:

    # k "In any occasion, we should resume our tour of the Academy."
    k "总之，我们应该继续参观学院了。"

# game/script.rpy:6479
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_031e8733:

    # k "There are many places you should visit before the end of the day."
    k "今天结束之前，你还有很多地方该去看看。"

# game/script.rpy:6483
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_3d3bfae8:

    # k "Shall we?"
    k "可以吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6485
translate schinese delinquents_ayumi_1_24d5cfba:

    # mc "Yeah, sure... Let's do that."
    mc "好啊，当然……那就去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6500
translate schinese satoe_intro_2b6ec913:

    # centered "After half an hour of walking around the Academy." with dd
    centered "在学院里走了半个小时之后。" with dd

# game/script.rpy:6503
translate schinese satoe_intro_0a70a6d5:

    # mc "Is that it, then?" with d
    mc "就这些了吗？" with d

# game/script.rpy:6504
translate schinese satoe_intro_60d7c5d5:

    # mc "I feel like I've seen every inch of this place."
    mc "我感觉这地方每一寸我都看过了。"

# game/script.rpy:6505
translate schinese satoe_intro_00dc59b1:

    # mc "And it's quite an eventful Academy..."
    mc "而且这学院还真是热闹非凡……"

# game/script.rpy:6506
translate schinese satoe_intro_14f4efe2:

    # mc "I gotta say... I'm a little tired of all that walking, is there somewhere else we need to go?"
    mc "我得说……走了这么多路我有点累了，还有别的地方要去吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6507
translate schinese satoe_intro_7c5346f7:

    # mc "Or should we go and take those pictures for the book now?"
    mc "还是我们现在就去拍那本书需要的照片？"

# game/script.rpy:6508
translate schinese satoe_intro_783803fa:

    # mc "If not, I could really use some rest..."
    mc "不的话，我真需要休息一下……"

# game/script.rpy:6514
translate schinese satoe_intro_2fd989d6:

    # k "I believe we have some free time before our Photographer is set up at our Photo Room." with d
    k "我想摄影师在摄影室准备好之前，应该还有一些空闲时间。" with d

# game/script.rpy:6515
translate schinese satoe_intro_f13ea404:

    # k "So we don't have anything planned at the moment."
    k "所以我们现在没什么安排。"

# game/script.rpy:6519
translate schinese satoe_intro_288bbec5:

    # mc "Oh yeah... That makes me think."
    mc "哦对了……这倒让我想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6520
translate schinese satoe_intro_4e2e384d:

    # mc "Why don't you use something that's not paper to organize your things?"
    mc "你为什么不用非纸的东西来整理你的东西呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6521
translate schinese satoe_intro_8041697d:

    # mc "You could have all of the things you need on a phone and not have to carry that thing everywhere."
    mc "你可以把所有需要的东西都放在手机里，不用到处带着那玩意儿。"

# game/script.rpy:6526
translate schinese satoe_intro_d9473294:

    # k "What you say is somewhat true."
    k "你说的多少有点道理。"

# game/script.rpy:6527
translate schinese satoe_intro_73d95cb0:

    # k "But these documents are confidential to you and me. No one in the Academy should have access to them."
    k "但这些文件只属于你我，学院里不该有任何人能接触到。"

# game/script.rpy:6528
translate schinese satoe_intro_15976df2:

    # k "And I find that physical things, like the paper I write in, tend to be reliable and secure."
    k "而且我发现，实体的东西，比如我写字用的纸，往往更可靠更安全。"

# game/script.rpy:6532
translate schinese satoe_intro_60f9c99b:

    # mc "They {i}could{/i} get stolen..."
    mc "它们{i}确实{/i}可能被偷……"

# game/script.rpy:6536
translate schinese satoe_intro_a055a66a:

    # k "That's why I carry it everywhere..."
    k "所以我才一直带着它……"

# game/script.rpy:6540
translate schinese satoe_intro_e89de7c6:

    # mc "Fair..."
    mc "……有道理。"

# game/script.rpy:6544
translate schinese satoe_intro_3c7f7450:

    # mc "But... You do have a phone, right?" with d
    mc "不过……你有手机吧？" with d

# game/script.rpy:6548
translate schinese satoe_intro_3d643228:

    # k "... I do."
    k "……有。"

# game/script.rpy:6552
translate schinese satoe_intro_ec4950d4:

    # mc "Great..."
    mc "很好……"

# game/script.rpy:6553
translate schinese satoe_intro_eee23da7:

    # mc "Do you have it on you?"
    mc "带在身上了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6557
translate schinese satoe_intro_8208d934:

    # k "Yes. I use it to monitor the cameras from the Academy as well. There are limitations to the physical tools I just described."
    k "带了。我还用它监控学院里的摄像机。我刚才说的那些实体工具有其局限。"

# game/script.rpy:6561
translate schinese satoe_intro_68f03e04:

    # mc "Cool..."
    mc "很好……"

# game/script.rpy:6565
translate schinese satoe_intro_068fd9a8:

    # mc "And...{w} What's your number?" with d
    mc "那个……{w}你的号码是多少？" with d

# game/script.rpy:6569
translate schinese satoe_intro_138d2a8a:

    # k "Hm..." with d
    k "嗯……" with d

# game/script.rpy:6571
translate schinese satoe_intro_ba97d207:

    # k "Have you brought up the subject about the limitations of the organization of the Academy Report Book as an excuse to ask for my number?"
    k "你是把学院报告册在组织上的局限性这个问题，当作要电话号码的借口吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6575
translate schinese satoe_intro_65a8e39f:

    # mc "{i}Eh...{/i} Not really... I'd say one thing led to another..."
    mc "{i}欸……{/i}不算是……该说是一件事牵出了另一件……"

# game/script.rpy:6576
translate schinese satoe_intro_5aa0613d:

    # mc "You know... Like a natural conversation."
    mc "你知道吧……就像很自然的对话。"

# game/script.rpy:6578
translate schinese satoe_intro_7c04dad4:

    # mct "(If she even knows what that means.)"
    mct "（她大概连那是什么意思都不知道。）"

# game/script.rpy:6581
translate schinese satoe_intro_501f5ab4:

    # k "To answer your question:{w} No, I will not give you my phone number, unless absolutely necessary." with d
    k "回答你的问题：{w}不，除非绝对必要，否则我不会给你我的电话号码。" with d

# game/script.rpy:6582
translate schinese satoe_intro_b78ae9c6:

    # k "Our relation will be strictly professional, you shouldn't waste your efforts on these courting attempts."
    k "我们的关系会严格保持职业性质，你不必在这些追求手段上浪费精力。"

# game/script.rpy:6583
translate schinese satoe_intro_fd91c03e:

    # k "As for your need to contact me during our Work period at the Academy, I'll make an effort to always be available to you."
    k "至于你在学院工作期间联系我的需要，我会尽量随时为你留出时间。"

# game/script.rpy:6584
translate schinese satoe_intro_52e7130b:

    # k "Should I find the need to exchange contact information, I'll do so."
    k "如果我觉得有必要交换联系方式，我会那么做的。"

# game/script.rpy:6588
translate schinese satoe_intro_84f512d6:

    # mc "Fine... It's like they say: The worst she can say is 'no'..."
    mc "好吧……就像俗话说的：最坏的结果无非是被拒绝……"

# game/script.rpy:6589
translate schinese satoe_intro_8b294ef4:

    # mc "And that's a {i}very{/i} long 'no'."
    mc "而这会是一个{i}非常{/i}漫长的『不』。"

# game/script.rpy:6594
translate schinese satoe_intro_d2091abe:

    # "*{xpr}WHACK{/xpr}*" with hpunch
    "*{xpr}啪{/xpr}*" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6595
translate schinese satoe_intro_5742cd0e:

    # _("Girl") "{i}Ow!!{/i}"
    _("女孩") "{i}哎!!{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:6598
translate schinese satoe_intro_9562f6e3:

    # mc "What was that?" with d
    mc "刚才那是什么声音？" with d

# game/script.rpy:6599
translate schinese satoe_intro_a0136429:

    # mc "Sounded like someone got hurt."
    mc "听起来像有人受伤了。"

# game/script.rpy:6603
translate schinese satoe_intro_b678cff4:

    # k "Hm."
    k "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:6605
translate schinese satoe_intro_be0e1483:

    # k "That came from Miss [sat]'s classroom."
    k "是从[sat]小姐的教室那边传来的。"

# game/script.rpy:6607
translate schinese satoe_intro_bb6d14b5:

    # k "We should go there. I'll introduce you to her. It might also be a good opportunity to learn something, and perhaps show something to our viewers."
    k "我们过去看看吧。我来给你介绍她。这可能也是个学到点东西的好机会，顺便还能给我们的观众看点什么。"

# game/script.rpy:6611
translate schinese satoe_intro_12f915ec:

    # k "Follow me..."
    k "跟我来……"

# game/script.rpy:6612
translate schinese satoe_intro_da6beff0:

    # mct "(Man... Right when I thought I'd get some rest...)"
    mct "（天哪……我还以为总算能休息一下了……）"

# game/script.rpy:6613
translate schinese satoe_intro_d72b8aaf:

    # mct "(Time to meet another nut job who works here.)"
    mct "（又要去见一个在这里打工的疯子了。）"

# game/script.rpy:6619
translate schinese satoe_intro_4bbb4aad:

    # "{xpr}*WHACK*{/xpr}" with hpunch
    "{xpr}*啪*{/xpr}" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6620
translate schinese satoe_intro_302a8044:

    # mc "Damn! What the hell is going on in there?"
    mc "靠！里面到底在搞什么？"

# game/script.rpy:6624
translate schinese satoe_intro_8078dbbc:

    # _("Girl") "Argh! Can I go now?" with d
    _("女孩") "啊呃!我现在能走了吗?" with d

# game/script.rpy:6625
translate schinese satoe_intro_78de2dbf:

    # sat "..."
    sat "……"

# game/script.rpy:6635
translate schinese satoe_intro_4bbb4aad_1:

    # "{xpr}*WHACK*{/xpr}" with hpunch
    "{xpr}*啪*{/xpr}" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6637
translate schinese satoe_intro_7c67c16f:

    # _("Girl") "Dude!! What the fuck!?"
    _("女孩") "喂!!搞什么啊!?"

# game/script.rpy:6642
translate schinese satoe_intro_f5c66c42:

    # sat "Watch your language, Miss [suz]." with d
    sat "注意用词，[suz]小姐。" with d

# game/script.rpy:6646
translate schinese satoe_intro_1b314fe6:

    # suz "Sorry... {size=-12}shit.{/size}"
    suz "抱歉……{size=-12}shit。{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:6650
translate schinese satoe_intro_5da2d392:

    # sat "...?"
    sat "……?"

# game/script.rpy:6654
translate schinese satoe_intro_4bbb4aad_2:

    # "{xpr}*WHACK*{/xpr}" with hpunch
    "{xpr}*啪*{/xpr}" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6658
translate schinese satoe_intro_04a96425:

    # sat "You know I heard that... And you're still forgetting something..."
    sat "我听到了哦……而且你还有件事没忘……"

# game/script.rpy:6662
translate schinese satoe_intro_b0e35984:

    # suz "{b}Ma'am!{/b} Sorry, Ma'am!" with dquick
    suz "{b}老师！{/b}对不起，老师！" with dquick

# game/script.rpy:6666
translate schinese satoe_intro_9758d457:

    # sat "Good."
    sat "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:6667
translate schinese satoe_intro_40be531f:

    # sat "Now, where was I?"
    sat "那么，我刚说到哪儿了？"

# game/script.rpy:6668
translate schinese satoe_intro_abff2738:

    # sat "Oh, that's right... There's five hits left."
    sat "哦，对了……还剩五下。"

# game/script.rpy:6669
translate schinese satoe_intro_da4e4034:

    # sat "Are you ready, Miss [suz]?"
    sat "准备好了吗，[suz]小姐？"

# game/script.rpy:6673
translate schinese satoe_intro_1a418c5d:

    # suz "{size=-12}No...{/size}"
    suz "{size=-12}不……{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:6679
translate schinese satoe_intro_f4407f2c:

    # sat "...?" with d
    sat "……?" with d

# game/script.rpy:6681
translate schinese satoe_intro_a3b0db13:

    # sat "How can I help you?"
    sat "有什么可以帮您？"

# game/script.rpy:6683
translate schinese satoe_intro_83a23794:

    # mc "Hello there." with d
    mc "你好。" with d

# game/script.rpy:6684
translate schinese satoe_intro_cb051f0e:

    # k "Sir, this is [sat], another one of our teachers."
    k "先生，这位是[sat]，我们的一位老师。"

# game/script.rpy:6685
translate schinese satoe_intro_43addd0c:

    # mc "I see... Nice to meet you, [sat]."
    mc "我明白了……很高兴认识你，[sat]。"

# game/script.rpy:6686
translate schinese satoe_intro_4a85567b:

    # mc "And, uh... I guess this is not a good time?"
    mc "还有，呃……我猜现在不是时候？"

# game/script.rpy:6688
translate schinese satoe_intro_ba6d08a1:

    # sat "Ah. You must be the new Academy Principal."
    sat "啊。您一定就是新来的学院理事长。"

# game/script.rpy:6689
translate schinese satoe_intro_c15ef412:

    # sat "Nice to meet you, Mr...?"
    sat "很高兴认识您，先生……？"

# game/script.rpy:6691
translate schinese satoe_intro_c2867e3b:

    # mc "[mc]..." with d
    mc "[mc]……" with d

# game/script.rpy:6694
translate schinese satoe_intro_83bbd809:

    # sat "Mr. [mc]. I heard a lot about you the last few days... It's a pleasure to finally meet you." with d
    sat "[mc]先生。这几天我听了不少关于您的事……终于见到您，非常荣幸。" with d

# game/script.rpy:6696
translate schinese satoe_intro_880a503f:

    # mc "So, what's happening here? What {i}crimes{/i} did she commit?"
    mc "那么，这里发生了什么？她犯了什么{i}罪{/i}？"

# game/script.rpy:6698
translate schinese satoe_intro_86f9ca49:

    # suz "Nothing, man... She's overreacting!"
    suz "没什么，老兄……她反应过度了！"

# game/script.rpy:6701
translate schinese satoe_intro_e7a0c826:

    # sat "Silence, [suz]!{w} Or I'll increase the hit count by one every time you speak!" with hpunch
    sat "安静，[suz]！{w}你每说一次话，我就把次数加一！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6705
translate schinese satoe_intro_21dfb832:

    # suz "Not cool..."
    suz "这样不好……"

# game/script.rpy:6709
translate schinese satoe_intro_fbc0c3a1:

    # sat "That will be six hits now."
    sat "现在是六下了。"

# game/script.rpy:6713
translate schinese satoe_intro_712c3640:

    # suz "{size=-12}Psycho bitch."
    suz "{size=-12}疯女人。"

# game/script.rpy:6716
translate schinese satoe_intro_6765113b:

    # sat "Seven!" with hpunch
    sat "七下！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6718
translate schinese satoe_intro_7d4499d8:

    # suz "..."
    suz "……"

# game/script.rpy:6721
translate schinese satoe_intro_ffce658d:

    # mc "Damn... Quite a method you have here, huh..." with d
    mc "靠……你的手段还真是……够独特的，哈……" with d

# game/script.rpy:6722
translate schinese satoe_intro_a5a5ace4:

    # mc "So, what did she do?"
    mc "那么，她做了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:6724
translate schinese satoe_intro_fd7b2e0b:

    # sat "[suz] keeps bringing that thing to our Academy Grounds..."
    sat "[suz]总是把那东西带到我们的校园里来……"

# game/script.rpy:6725
translate schinese satoe_intro_0ca3996e:

    # sat "... And today, while {i}playing{/i} around with the boys, she hit one of the windows with a ball."
    sat "……而今天，她在跟男生们{i}玩{/i}的时候，用球把一扇窗户砸中了。"

# game/script.rpy:6726
translate schinese satoe_intro_e5aaf2cb:

    # sat "As you can imagine, she shattered and broke it."
    sat "你可以想象，窗户被打碎了。"

# game/script.rpy:6727
translate schinese satoe_intro_329fa5e2:

    # sat "Our Janitor, Mr. [masaru.surname], had to deal with the mess she made."
    sat "我们的清洁工，[masaru.surname]先生，不得不收拾她弄出来的烂摊子。"

# game/script.rpy:6728
translate schinese satoe_intro_f4f69a25:

    # sat "So, as you can see, I am dealing with the issue in a more direct approach."
    sat "所以，如你所见，我处理这个问题用的是更直接的方式。"

# game/script.rpy:6732
translate schinese satoe_intro_cc029ffd:

    # mc "Why not just give her a strike?"
    mc "为什么不干脆给她记一次过？"

# game/script.rpy:6734
translate schinese satoe_intro_c6355f12:

    # mc "Teachers can do that, right, [k]?"
    mc "老师可以这么做，对吧，[k]？"

# game/script.rpy:6736
translate schinese satoe_intro_e1946810:

    # k "Correct."
    k "正确。"

# game/script.rpy:6742
translate schinese satoe_intro_5d097f17:

    # sat "... Honestly, I think my methods work better."
    sat "……坦白说，我觉得我的方法更有效。"

# game/script.rpy:6747
translate schinese satoe_intro_8a0e6a82:

    # sat "Since [suz] here doesn't have a single strike yet, she might feel there's no consequences for her actions."
    sat "因为[suz]到现在一次记过都没有，她可能觉得自己的行为不会带来任何后果。"

# game/script.rpy:6748
translate schinese satoe_intro_d0b3e703:

    # sat "I intend to prove otherwise..."
    sat "我打算证明恰恰相反……"

# game/script.rpy:6750
translate schinese satoe_intro_d5ae2301:

    # mc "Fair enough."
    mc "有道理。"

# game/script.rpy:6752
translate schinese satoe_intro_9758d457_1:

    # sat "Good."
    sat "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:6756
translate schinese satoe_intro_34a09c2c:

    # sat "Now, if you don't mind, I'll get back to it."
    sat "那么，如果你不介意，我要继续了。"

# game/script.rpy:6757
translate schinese satoe_intro_5c36ead4:

    # sat "You're welcome to watch and determine for yourself if my methods are effective."
    sat "欢迎观看，自己判断一下我的方法有没有效。"

# game/script.rpy:6761
translate schinese satoe_intro_4cbba131:

    # suz "Hey, man, I'll take a strike or whatever that is instead of this shit."
    suz "喂，老兄，让我去记一次过还是什么的吧，总比这破玩意强。"

# game/script.rpy:6765
